(927323, 107893, 9089, '<td valign="top">Seem to remember seeing this location/similar photo a while back...  My only problem with this is it is really difficult to see what it is in the photo.  You could have played with that by a title like "Circuit Board?"  But as it is, it just looks like a bunch of little ''things''</td>', 'Seem to remember seeing this location/similar photo a while back...  My only problem with this is it is really difficult to see what it is in the photo.  You could have played with that by a title like "Circuit Board?"  But as it is, it just looks like a bunch of little ''things''', '2004-09-27 02:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(927325, 107338, 17103, '<td valign="top">Lovely....</td>', 'Lovely....', '2004-09-27 02:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(927327, 106825, 9089, '<td valign="top">The fading of the coloring from pink to gray give the eye an ''animal'' character.  I wish you had left the skin natural colors.</td>', 'The fading of the coloring from pink to gray give the eye an ''animal'' character.  I wish you had left the skin natural colors.', '2004-09-27 02:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(927329, 108100, 5792, '<td valign="top">Contrasting architectural styles in a very fine image. Quality is exceptionally good and fine detail without pixelation makes this one of the top images of this challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-04 02:36:58.</i></td>', 'Contrasting architectural styles in a very fine image. Quality is exceptionally good and fine detail without pixelation makes this one of the top images of this challenge.', '2004-09-27 02:11:54.000000', '2004-10-04 03:36:58.000000', 1),
