(927366, 107338, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.</td>', 'Interesting photo.', '2004-09-27 02:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(927367, 107338, 15891, '<td valign="top">This image is just good... it''s very emotive and I really like the dark, brooding atmosphere of the scene. Kudos to you for thinking outside the box!</td>', 'This image is just good... it''s very emotive and I really like the dark, brooding atmosphere of the scene. Kudos to you for thinking outside the box!', '2004-09-27 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(927368, 106581, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Shadow is a little bit distracting ... don''t know how to advice you about this.  Perhaps a frontal shot, tight crop and wait for the shadow to subside?</td>', 'Good subject.  Shadow is a little bit distracting ... don''t know how to advice you about this.  Perhaps a frontal shot, tight crop and wait for the shadow to subside?', '2004-09-27 02:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(927371, 108069, 12962, '<td valign="top">You mean a teen-aged daughter?  You hit the mark!</td>', 'You mean a teen-aged daughter?  You hit the mark!', '2004-09-27 02:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(927377, 107753, 23478, '<td valign="top">Well done, I think this is an excellent photo.</td>', 'Well done, I think this is an excellent photo.', '2004-09-27 02:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(927378, 107817, 12962, '<td valign="top">What a classic piece of work this is! 10.</td>', 'What a classic piece of work this is! 10.', '2004-09-27 02:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(927381, 107525, 9089, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the one small individual really helps to make the shot.  It is definitely complex, almost to the point where I have no place to rest my eyes, until I saw the person...</td>', 'The inclusion of the one small individual really helps to make the shot.  It is definitely complex, almost to the point where I have no place to rest my eyes, until I saw the person...', '2004-09-27 02:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(927382, 107963, 12962, '<td valign="top">That is very complex!  Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'That is very complex!  Thanks for sharing!', '2004-09-27 02:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(927384, 107904, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great photo.</td>', 'Great photo.', '2004-09-27 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(927385, 107571, 9089, '<td valign="top">Good abstract, I could definitely see this on a wall somewhere.</td>', 'Good abstract, I could definitely see this on a wall somewhere.', '2004-09-27 02:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(927388, 107934, 9089, '<td valign="top">With the title, I was expecting a football scene from Dan Devine, but now I see it is a flower from God, or Divine Design.  the downward facing of the flower makes my eyes just fall out of the picture.  Seems like it would be better rotated.</td>', 'With the title, I was expecting a football scene from Dan Devine, but now I see it is a flower from God, or Divine Design.  the downward facing of the flower makes my eyes just fall out of the picture.  Seems like it would be better rotated.', '2004-09-27 02:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(927390, 108089, 9089, '<td valign="top">Just a slightly higher angle, so that the Chevy symbol isn''t touching the edge of the photo would make this better.  Especially since it is the only real recognizable thing in the picture, it draws the eyes attention, but touching the edge of the photo, then takes your eyes off all that fabulous shiny stuff.</td>', 'Just a slightly higher angle, so that the Chevy symbol isn''t touching the edge of the photo would make this better.  Especially since it is the only real recognizable thing in the picture, it draws the eyes attention, but touching the edge of the photo, then takes your eyes off all that fabulous shiny stuff.', '2004-09-27 02:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(927414, 107331, 10268, '<td valign="top">The first thing I thought of when the topic came up was the human body.  I suppose human nature is fairly complex as well, but I don''t get a sense of that in the photo.  I''t''s an awesome portrait, I''m just not getting a sense of complexity.</td>', 'The first thing I thought of when the topic came up was the human body.  I suppose human nature is fairly complex as well, but I don''t get a sense of that in the photo.  I''t''s an awesome portrait, I''m just not getting a sense of complexity.', '2004-09-27 02:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(927417, 107596, 9089, '<td valign="top">Needs to either be rotated a little counter clockwise to level the ORIS in the middle, or rotated more clockwise to show that it is meant to be not level.</td>', 'Needs to either be rotated a little counter clockwise to level the ORIS in the middle, or rotated more clockwise to show that it is meant to be not level.', '2004-09-27 03:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(927418, 107691, 10867, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image.</td>', 'Fascinating image.', '2004-09-27 03:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(927419, 107376, 10268, '<td valign="top">No, not really.  Complex?  Straws are so basic.<br/> <br/>Looks a bit overhsarpened, and the black and white works well.</td>', 'No, not really.  Complex?  Straws are so basic. Looks a bit overhsarpened, and the black and white works well.', '2004-09-27 03:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(927422, 107258, 10268, '<td valign="top">Definitely complex.  My eyes wander all over the photo.  <br/> <br/>I this could have been composed better.  Shooting it flat like this makes it seem really boring.</td>', 'Definitely complex.  My eyes wander all over the photo.   I this could have been composed better.  Shooting it flat like this makes it seem really boring.', '2004-09-27 03:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(927423, 108067, 10268, '<td valign="top">the lighting seems kind of flat, but the green tone is awesome.  Well composed, and definitely complex.</td>', 'the lighting seems kind of flat, but the green tone is awesome.  Well composed, and definitely complex.', '2004-09-27 03:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(927426, 107292, 10268, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to judge something when I have no clue what it is.<br/> <br/>But composition is good.</td>', 'It''s hard to judge something when I have no clue what it is. But composition is good.', '2004-09-27 03:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(927427, 107898, 14863, '<td valign="top">I have   NO idea what''s  going on here  but it''s so weird that it''s awesome- great job- I give a 10  for makin'' me think :D</td>', 'I have   NO idea what''s  going on here  but it''s so weird that it''s awesome- great job- I give a 10  for makin'' me think :D', '2004-09-27 03:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(927429, 107893, 10268, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a photo like this.  Seems almost exactly the same shot.  Must be a famous place?<br/> <br/>I don''t know.  Anyway.</td>', 'I''ve seen a photo like this.  Seems almost exactly the same shot.  Must be a famous place? I don''t know.  Anyway.', '2004-09-27 03:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(927441, 107479, 9089, '<td valign="top">I wanted to really like this shot when I saw it in the thumbnail.  But seeing it larger, the DOF seems off to me, I think if it was razor sharp through the whole photo, would be much better.</td>', 'I wanted to really like this shot when I saw it in the thumbnail.  But seeing it larger, the DOF seems off to me, I think if it was razor sharp through the whole photo, would be much better.', '2004-09-27 03:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(927444, 108007, 25906, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the blue(trashcan) is a bit distracting...</td>', 'Nice, but the blue(trashcan) is a bit distracting...', '2004-09-27 03:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(927447, 107773, 9089, '<td valign="top">Too many focus points in different locations.  What this means is that as my eyes go from one place in focus, to another, to another, the eyes travel over areas that are not in focus, causing them to strain a little with each movement.  Try to simplify the focus.</td>', 'Too many focus points in different locations.  What this means is that as my eyes go from one place in focus, to another, to another, the eyes travel over areas that are not in focus, causing them to strain a little with each movement.  Try to simplify the focus.', '2004-09-27 03:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(927452, 107535, 9089, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle on this web, makes it stand out from the other spiderweb shots in the challenge.  I also like the subtle contrast of the weaving at the bottom giving the man-made web as well.</td>', 'Interesting angle on this web, makes it stand out from the other spiderweb shots in the challenge.  I also like the subtle contrast of the weaving at the bottom giving the man-made web as well.', '2004-09-27 04:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
