(927497, 107908, 5354, '<td valign="top">Just lost the extreme right hand edge, shame</td>', 'Just lost the extreme right hand edge, shame', '2004-09-27 05:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(927498, 107458, 5354, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, however the glare and lens flare on the right hand side really spoils this. You need to use a lens hood to stop that happening, or hold your hand up to shade the front of the lens.</td>', 'I like the concept, however the glare and lens flare on the right hand side really spoils this. You need to use a lens hood to stop that happening, or hold your hand up to shade the front of the lens.', '2004-09-27 05:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(927500, 107763, 5354, '<td valign="top">I think theres a much better photo lurking inside this. The lighting is quite flat which doesn''t bring out the textures in the seeds. With some directional lighting this could really sing.<br/></td>', 'I think theres a much better photo lurking inside this. The lighting is quite flat which doesn''t bring out the textures in the seeds. With some directional lighting this could really sing.', '2004-09-27 05:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(927501, 107983, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a fantasitc image, one you should be proud of. I''m a sucker for urban decay and while I''m not sure how it fits the challenge,  I can''t vote, so what do I care?!</td>', 'This is a fantasitc image, one you should be proud of. I''m a sucker for urban decay and while I''m not sure how it fits the challenge,  I can''t vote, so what do I care?!', '2004-09-27 05:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(927502, 107390, 5354, '<td valign="top">The wooden dolls really start to get depressing after a few challenges. Sorry</td>', 'The wooden dolls really start to get depressing after a few challenges. Sorry', '2004-09-27 05:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(927503, 108091, 23458, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great capture of a peacock feather, I just wonder whether the crop was too severe, the image is a little small on this site, and You''ll probably get marked down for that</td>', 'This looks like a great capture of a peacock feather, I just wonder whether the crop was too severe, the image is a little small on this site, and You''ll probably get marked down for that', '2004-09-27 05:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(927504, 107753, 5354, '<td valign="top">Not very appealing shadow behind the stalk. With a little thought this could have been avoided. Nice concept though, needs more ''artistry''.</td>', 'Not very appealing shadow behind the stalk. With a little thought this could have been avoided. Nice concept though, needs more ''artistry''.', '2004-09-27 05:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(927505, 107620, 19952, '<td valign="top">I am really curious how you accomplished this, so I can''t wait to read your description after the contest. This is a great idea for a photograph and works well for this challenge.</td>', 'I am really curious how you accomplished this, so I can''t wait to read your description after the contest. This is a great idea for a photograph and works well for this challenge.', '2004-09-27 05:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(927509, 107893, 5354, '<td valign="top">Ah the Royal Armouries - excellent</td>', 'Ah the Royal Armouries - excellent', '2004-09-27 05:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(927510, 107687, 5354, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop might have been better on this. I feel there is a lot of wasted dark space.</td>', 'A tighter crop might have been better on this. I feel there is a lot of wasted dark space.', '2004-09-27 05:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(927512, 107292, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK, meets the challenge, but there''s not ''artistry'' to the image, nothing ''extra'', just a plain old chip. Needs to be enhanced with your interpretation. all you have done is show your mastery of the camera in order to capture a representation of an object. Its sharp, its reasonably presented, but its also boring.<br/> <br/>Sorry to be so critical.</td>', 'OK, meets the challenge, but there''s not ''artistry'' to the image, nothing ''extra'', just a plain old chip. Needs to be enhanced with your interpretation. all you have done is show your mastery of the camera in order to capture a representation of an object. Its sharp, its reasonably presented, but its also boring. Sorry to be so critical.', '2004-09-27 06:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
