(927887, 108059, 19978, '<td valign="top">As DPC astro shots go, this is one of the better moons I''ve seen. That said, it''s pretty much over-sharpened, but I don''t think most voters are going to mind. As for the challenge, I think I see your point, but I think it''s a bit of a stretch for the challenge, and will probably be voted down accordingly. I give you a 6 because I know it''s not easy to get a good shot. I''ll be anxious to see if you used a telescope or a zoom lens.</td>', 'As DPC astro shots go, this is one of the better moons I''ve seen. That said, it''s pretty much over-sharpened, but I don''t think most voters are going to mind. As for the challenge, I think I see your point, but I think it''s a bit of a stretch for the challenge, and will probably be voted down accordingly. I give you a 6 because I know it''s not easy to get a good shot. I''ll be anxious to see if you used a telescope or a zoom lens.', '2004-09-27 11:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
