(928796, 108101, 15407, '<td valign="top">The incredible symmetry youve captured here is wonderful. Its quite difficult to get a shot like this as well as you did. I would have preferred it with a cropping of 10x480 pixels off the right side of the shot even more.</td>', 'The incredible symmetry youve captured here is wonderful. Its quite difficult to get a shot like this as well as you did. I would have preferred it with a cropping of 10x480 pixels off the right side of the shot even more.', '2004-09-28 02:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(928797, 107893, 4767, '<td valign="top">Her Majesty has a lot of interesting weaponry.  Excellent photo.</td>', 'Her Majesty has a lot of interesting weaponry.  Excellent photo.', '2004-09-28 02:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(928798, 106825, 4767, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2004-09-28 02:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(928807, 107895, 4767, '<td valign="top">Looks like the Albuquerque balloon gestival with a patriotic theme!  Not wholly originl to dpc, but a superior example of how to do this RIGHT.</td>', 'Looks like the Albuquerque balloon gestival with a patriotic theme!  Not wholly originl to dpc, but a superior example of how to do this RIGHT.', '2004-09-28 02:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(928819, 107973, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and light.</td>', 'Wonderful color and light.', '2004-09-28 02:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(928820, 107893, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is amazing. I like that it is so symetrical. This adds to the feeling of complexity.</td>', 'Wow... this is amazing. I like that it is so symetrical. This adds to the feeling of complexity.', '2004-09-28 02:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(928822, 108091, 22046, '<td valign="top">An elegant and beautiful feather. And, yes, complex in its simplicity.</td>', 'An elegant and beautiful feather. And, yes, complex in its simplicity.', '2004-09-28 02:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(928823, 107453, 22046, '<td valign="top">Now that''s complex. Great  lighting and color.</td>', 'Now that''s complex. Great  lighting and color.', '2004-09-28 02:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(928824, 108101, 22046, '<td valign="top">Yes, this fits the challenge very well. Love all the shapes and designs in this ceiling.</td>', 'Yes, this fits the challenge very well. Love all the shapes and designs in this ceiling.', '2004-09-28 02:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(928826, 107780, 10867, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and clarity of this image very much, but the image seems to me to exemplify elegant simplicity rather than complexity.</td>', 'I like the composition and clarity of this image very much, but the image seems to me to exemplify elegant simplicity rather than complexity.', '2004-09-28 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(928827, 107650, 22046, '<td valign="top">Gives a human touc to the idea of complexity. Like the warm cast to the colors.</td>', 'Gives a human touc to the idea of complexity. Like the warm cast to the colors.', '2004-09-28 02:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(928828, 108064, 10867, '<td valign="top">Too much of this image is in deep shadow with no detail visible, unfortunately.</td>', 'Too much of this image is in deep shadow with no detail visible, unfortunately.', '2004-09-28 02:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(928829, 107922, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful and elegant.</td>', 'This is very beautiful and elegant.', '2004-09-28 02:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(928833, 106825, 22046, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of the complexity of the human mind. Well done.</td>', 'This makes me think of the complexity of the human mind. Well done.', '2004-09-28 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(928834, 107519, 22046, '<td valign="top">the best of the clock and watch pictures in my opinion. Love all the patterns in the steel work.</td>', 'the best of the clock and watch pictures in my opinion. Love all the patterns in the steel work.', '2004-09-28 02:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(928836, 106818, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of straight and curved shapes. This works well in sepia.</td>', 'I like the combination of straight and curved shapes. This works well in sepia.', '2004-09-28 02:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(928837, 107525, 22046, '<td valign="top">Complexity of line, shape and form with shadow as an added  element. Excellent.</td>', 'Complexity of line, shape and form with shadow as an added  element. Excellent.', '2004-09-28 02:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(928844, 107895, 16829, '<td valign="top">Fantastic</td>', 'Fantastic', '2004-09-28 02:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(928855, 107292, 16829, '<td valign="top">I am really tired of people taking pictures of circuit boards, or the innards of hard drives placing it at an angle that''s "interesting". That''s why I like this picture. You''ve focused down to a true abstraction and used color to highlight the beauty of the object. Can''t say its one of my favorites of the group, but, well done in any case.</td>', 'I am really tired of people taking pictures of circuit boards, or the innards of hard drives placing it at an angle that''s "interesting". That''s why I like this picture. You''ve focused down to a true abstraction and used color to highlight the beauty of the object. Can''t say its one of my favorites of the group, but, well done in any case.', '2004-09-28 02:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(928865, 107843, 27103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-09-28 03:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(928937, 107693, 23251, '<td valign="top">Gone<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-04 09:13:17.</i></td>', 'Gone', '2004-09-28 09:08:28.000000', '2004-10-04 10:13:17.000000', 1),
(928973, 108067, 8643, '<td valign="top">Well done, like the reflected board!</td>', 'Well done, like the reflected board!', '2004-09-28 10:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(928974, 107623, 8643, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly lit and captured.</td>', 'Brilliantly lit and captured.', '2004-09-28 10:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(928990, 107829, 9504, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  Great photograph for complexity.  This is complex!  I just wish it had a little more light...8</td>', 'This is really cool.  Great photograph for complexity.  This is complex!  I just wish it had a little more light...8', '2004-09-28 11:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(928996, 108104, 9504, '<td valign="top">What is this??</td>', 'What is this??', '2004-09-28 11:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(928998, 107989, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the choice in angling the composition. It adds a nice sense of depth to an otherwise flat subject.</td>', 'I like the choice in angling the composition. It adds a nice sense of depth to an otherwise flat subject.', '2004-09-28 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(928999, 107747, 9504, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-09-28 11:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(929000, 107650, 12661, '<td valign="top">I understand the choice in cropping to highlight the complexity of the skin, but I think you are sitting in the middle of the road here. Either a tighter crop of the hands or a wider crop including the entire person would have been preferable. As it is, I am seing too much of what you didn''t intend to show me. It leaves me wanting to see more of the people.</td>', 'I understand the choice in cropping to highlight the complexity of the skin, but I think you are sitting in the middle of the road here. Either a tighter crop of the hands or a wider crop including the entire person would have been preferable. As it is, I am seing too much of what you didn''t intend to show me. It leaves me wanting to see more of the people.', '2004-09-28 11:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(929003, 107574, 25378, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but it would have been better with color.</td>', 'I like this image, but it would have been better with color.', '2004-09-28 11:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(929005, 107620, 12661, '<td valign="top">That is a very interesting tehnique and, seing that it is validated, I hope you comment on how you did it. I look forward to comming back to see. Overall, it doesn''t realy scream complexity to me. Actually, the image would speak more to simplicity as you have taken a 3-D object and simplified it to a line drawing. On the other hand, the technique you used to do this is probably quite complex so I will grant you the challenge topic on that alone. Overall, the only thing that bothers me is the fact that the top right corner of the cartridge is obscured. It''s nit-picky, but I am an information junkie, and when their is some information that I can''t see, it somewhat bothers me. But aside from my peeves, the composition is very well balanced. Nicely done.</td>', 'That is a very interesting tehnique and, seing that it is validated, I hope you comment on how you did it. I look forward to comming back to see. Overall, it doesn''t realy scream complexity to me. Actually, the image would speak more to simplicity as you have taken a 3-D object and simplified it to a line drawing. On the other hand, the technique you used to do this is probably quite complex so I will grant you the challenge topic on that alone. Overall, the only thing that bothers me is the fact that the top right corner of the cartridge is obscured. It''s nit-picky, but I am an information junkie, and when their is some information that I can''t see, it somewhat bothers me. But aside from my peeves, the composition is very well balanced. Nicely done.', '2004-09-28 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(929008, 107806, 25378, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! I hope you do better.</td>', 'One of my favorites! I hope you do better.', '2004-09-28 11:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(929015, 107260, 9073, '<td valign="top">What a lovely sunset! The variations in the clouds are certainly complex, and the colours are wonderful. I''d have cloned out what looks to be dust and maybe have cropped off a little from the bottom. Nice work.</td>', 'What a lovely sunset! The variations in the clouds are certainly complex, and the colours are wonderful. I''d have cloned out what looks to be dust and maybe have cropped off a little from the bottom. Nice work.', '2004-09-28 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(929017, 106642, 12661, '<td valign="top">Gears? Complex? Aren''t they classified as simple machines? ;) Alright, I''ll stop being a geeky engineer and look at this photo as a photographer. The composition is very good and well balanced. The only thing I would change is to give the bottom of the derailleur a bit more room. It''s looks somewhat crowded with the close crop. Also, the spokes just left of the derailleur look a tad out of focus and some others (along with parts of the frame) are refelcting too much light. But believe me, I know how hard it is to not get bright reflections when photographing round metalic objects. As far as the color of the grass, I suspect you may get a few comments about it not being green. Personally, I like the desaturation. It gives the grass a metalic feel that ties it in nicely with the subject.</td>', 'Gears? Complex? Aren''t they classified as simple machines? ;) Alright, I''ll stop being a geeky engineer and look at this photo as a photographer. The composition is very good and well balanced. The only thing I would change is to give the bottom of the derailleur a bit more room. It''s looks somewhat crowded with the close crop. Also, the spokes just left of the derailleur look a tad out of focus and some others (along with parts of the frame) are refelcting too much light. But believe me, I know how hard it is to not get bright reflections when photographing round metalic objects. As far as the color of the grass, I suspect you may get a few comments about it not being green. Personally, I like the desaturation. It gives the grass a metalic feel that ties it in nicely with the subject.', '2004-09-28 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(929018, 106825, 9073, '<td valign="top">While this is a fantastic image, I feel that the eye needs a bit more space to the left and the pupil should be in perfect crispness. 8</td>', 'While this is a fantastic image, I feel that the eye needs a bit more space to the left and the pupil should be in perfect crispness. 8', '2004-09-28 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(929021, 107893, 9073, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect of a 2-dimensional design. Even though you''ve obviously shot upwards, it feels some Indian design with a pentagon at the top supported by some intricate pattern work. Lovely. 9</td>', 'I really like the effect of a 2-dimensional design. Even though you''ve obviously shot upwards, it feels some Indian design with a pentagon at the top supported by some intricate pattern work. Lovely. 9', '2004-09-28 11:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(929022, 107934, 9073, '<td valign="top">The flower is captured wonderfully, but there''s far too much unnecessary space to the left.</td>', 'The flower is captured wonderfully, but there''s far too much unnecessary space to the left.', '2004-09-28 11:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(929027, 107904, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful capture. My only suggestion would be to rotate the whole image on its left/right axis to have the lights leading the eye left to right, as in how we read, rather than back out of the frame. 6</td>', 'This is a beautiful capture. My only suggestion would be to rotate the whole image on its left/right axis to have the lights leading the eye left to right, as in how we read, rather than back out of the frame. 6', '2004-09-28 11:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
