(929448, 107911, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top 3 images in this challenge and that''s nothing to do with your being my hubby.<br/> <br/>I really like the way the top plate thingy creates a sweeping and slightly curved line across the image. I like the way the upright thingies create strong verticals to balance that. I like the shallow DOF that throws out the background. I like the repetitive patterns of the cogs, I like the way the light is reflected by the metal but the way I can still see the texture of the surfaces. And I like the conversion to black and white. And the crop.</td>', 'This is one of my top 3 images in this challenge and that''s nothing to do with your being my hubby. I really like the way the top plate thingy creates a sweeping and slightly curved line across the image. I like the way the upright thingies create strong verticals to balance that. I like the shallow DOF that throws out the background. I like the repetitive patterns of the cogs, I like the way the light is reflected by the metal but the way I can still see the texture of the surfaces. And I like the conversion to black and white. And the crop.', '2004-09-28 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(929451, 106529, 3087, '<td valign="top">This image fascinates me. I had to think long and hard about my score for it because I really felt I was marking the work of art rather than the photograph itself. I decided in the end that since the main element of the art was a photographic image and that the composition and content of that image appealed strongly that I''d give it a high score anyway. It''s one of my favourite three.</td>', 'This image fascinates me. I had to think long and hard about my score for it because I really felt I was marking the work of art rather than the photograph itself. I decided in the end that since the main element of the art was a photographic image and that the composition and content of that image appealed strongly that I''d give it a high score anyway. It''s one of my favourite three.', '2004-09-28 17:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(929452, 108023, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.   I think the way the foreground rock formation is brightly lit adds to the picture.   Great depth of field -- this is crystal clear all the way front to back, top to bottom.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.   I think the way the foreground rock formation is brightly lit adds to the picture.   Great depth of field -- this is crystal clear all the way front to back, top to bottom.', '2004-09-28 17:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(929454, 107960, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of my top three and certainly my favourite out of the various excellent spider web entries. I expected to like one of the more complete webs more, one of those where the centre of the web was carefully positioned off-centre within the frame and droplets caught the light. But this assymetrical one appealed more. I like the loose composition, the texture of light and shade in the background and the high contrast black and white treatment. Lovely!</td>', 'One of my top three and certainly my favourite out of the various excellent spider web entries. I expected to like one of the more complete webs more, one of those where the centre of the web was carefully positioned off-centre within the frame and droplets caught the light. But this assymetrical one appealed more. I like the loose composition, the texture of light and shade in the background and the high contrast black and white treatment. Lovely!', '2004-09-28 17:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(929455, 107973, 24079, '<td valign="top">beautiful! the lighting is magnifisent</td>', 'beautiful! the lighting is magnifisent', '2004-09-28 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(929458, 107386, 24079, '<td valign="top">the open space to the right is a little distracting but i love the bits of red which make the photo pop</td>', 'the open space to the right is a little distracting but i love the bits of red which make the photo pop', '2004-09-28 18:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(929459, 107747, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! <br/>What depth of detail! The colours and shapes of the buildings and lights are excellent. Feels like I can fly right into it and still see more and more. And a lovely sky to top it all off. <br/> <br/>This is one of my top 10 images in this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful! What depth of detail! The colours and shapes of the buildings and lights are excellent. Feels like I can fly right into it and still see more and more. And a lovely sky to top it all off.  This is one of my top 10 images in this challenge.', '2004-09-28 18:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(929461, 107525, 3087, '<td valign="top">An unusual viewpoint plus some great geometric shapes and colours makes this one of my top 10 in this challenge. I like the way that you''ve taken a fascinating architectural site but created something fresh and new in your view of it. The composition just screams out to me. It feels so dynamic.</td>', 'An unusual viewpoint plus some great geometric shapes and colours makes this one of my top 10 in this challenge. I like the way that you''ve taken a fascinating architectural site but created something fresh and new in your view of it. The composition just screams out to me. It feels so dynamic.', '2004-09-28 18:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(929463, 106581, 24079, '<td valign="top">the lighting just isn''t right.... the light is highlighting the back but instead should be shining on the face.... this is a good picture though and has a lot of potential</td>', 'the lighting just isn''t right.... the light is highlighting the back but instead should be shining on the face.... this is a good picture though and has a lot of potential', '2004-09-28 18:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(929464, 108031, 3087, '<td valign="top">My second favourite spider web image and in my top 10 favourite images in this challenge. I really like the off-centred composition, the high contrast and the strong geometric pattern.</td>', 'My second favourite spider web image and in my top 10 favourite images in this challenge. I really like the off-centred composition, the high contrast and the strong geometric pattern.', '2004-09-28 18:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(929467, 108100, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I really like how you cut the frame in half diagonally - it echoes the divide between the old and new styles of architecture within this city. I also like the two golden window lines of the new building - they definitely add to the overall pattern for me. This is one of my top 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I really like how you cut the frame in half diagonally - it echoes the divide between the old and new styles of architecture within this city. I also like the two golden window lines of the new building - they definitely add to the overall pattern for me. This is one of my top 10 for this challenge.', '2004-09-28 18:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(929468, 107519, 24079, '<td valign="top">I love the shapes of the gears but the black spaces in the corners are distracting. overall the picture is good and you have such a wonderful idea!</td>', 'I love the shapes of the gears but the black spaces in the corners are distracting. overall the picture is good and you have such a wonderful idea!', '2004-09-28 18:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(929471, 107893, 3087, '<td valign="top">Despite having no interest in the steel implements themselves I love the "pattern" of this image. It makes a great geometric abstract and I like the colours, shapes, light and shadows. Not only a great choice of viewpoint but also great composition choice not to centre the ceiling in the frame. One of my 10 favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Despite having no interest in the steel implements themselves I love the "pattern" of this image. It makes a great geometric abstract and I like the colours, shapes, light and shadows. Not only a great choice of viewpoint but also great composition choice not to centre the ceiling in the frame. One of my 10 favourites in this challenge.', '2004-09-28 18:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(929473, 106642, 24079, '<td valign="top">wonderful idea but the picture just doesn''t please the eyes. i think this idea could have been taken further with maybe a different background and lighting... keep up the good work! it''s so fun to learn more techniques and tips and this website provides a lot of help</td>', 'wonderful idea but the picture just doesn''t please the eyes. i think this idea could have been taken further with maybe a different background and lighting... keep up the good work! it''s so fun to learn more techniques and tips and this website provides a lot of help', '2004-09-28 18:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(929474, 107773, 3087, '<td valign="top">This image has grown on me each time I''ve viewed it. It''s now among my 10 favourites for this challenge. <br/> <br/>I really like the simplicity of presentation of a complex subject. The colours are incredibly vibrant. The shallow DOF works very well, especially because I think you''ve got the plane of focus in exactly the right place. I like the way I can see the detail of the design of this tree in that plane and yet just the shape of it in front of and behind the plane. I think what I''m saying is that I like the way the plane of focus is not the foremost part of the object. Composition works well for me with the curve enclosing the bottom left corner and the other main branch thrusting out from top right to lower right. <br/> <br/>Very nice indeed!</td>', 'This image has grown on me each time I''ve viewed it. It''s now among my 10 favourites for this challenge.  I really like the simplicity of presentation of a complex subject. The colours are incredibly vibrant. The shallow DOF works very well, especially because I think you''ve got the plane of focus in exactly the right place. I like the way I can see the detail of the design of this tree in that plane and yet just the shape of it in front of and behind the plane. I think what I''m saying is that I like the way the plane of focus is not the foremost part of the object. Composition works well for me with the curve enclosing the bottom left corner and the other main branch thrusting out from top right to lower right.  Very nice indeed!', '2004-09-28 18:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(929475, 106529, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and complex!!   I can''t wait to see how you did this one!</td>', 'Very interesting and complex!!   I can''t wait to see how you did this one!', '2004-09-28 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(929478, 106818, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of unusual viewpoint to create a great composition. I really like the interplay of the round building, the triangular aspect of the regular building and the abstract element of the sculpture. Whereas normally I like a sky with some detail I think this plain sky works excellently in this image. Great mix of regular and abstract patterns both in the subject matter and your composition.<br/> <br/>On of my top 10 this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent use of unusual viewpoint to create a great composition. I really like the interplay of the round building, the triangular aspect of the regular building and the abstract element of the sculpture. Whereas normally I like a sky with some detail I think this plain sky works excellently in this image. Great mix of regular and abstract patterns both in the subject matter and your composition. On of my top 10 this challenge.', '2004-09-28 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(929479, 108111, 24079, '<td valign="top">wow wonderful colors and the yellow gives the flower that special pop. only one problem though... the flower looks slightly too blurry.</td>', 'wow wonderful colors and the yellow gives the flower that special pop. only one problem though... the flower looks slightly too blurry.', '2004-09-28 18:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(929481, 107991, 24079, '<td valign="top">the petals are too washed out which is distracting... but the flower is beautiful and I love the red!</td>', 'the petals are too washed out which is distracting... but the flower is beautiful and I love the red!', '2004-09-28 18:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(929486, 108110, 24079, '<td valign="top">i really like the angle of this one! i also like the lights and the effects they create on the walls</td>', 'i really like the angle of this one! i also like the lights and the effects they create on the walls', '2004-09-28 18:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(929488, 107998, 24079, '<td valign="top">I like how you can see the sky through the flowers. some of the flowers to the left look a little washed out, but this is a wonderful picture and such an original idea!</td>', 'I like how you can see the sky through the flowers. some of the flowers to the left look a little washed out, but this is a wonderful picture and such an original idea!', '2004-09-28 18:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(929491, 107535, 24079, '<td valign="top">the lighting and colors create a really cool effect and mood. maybe you could add an unsharpen filter to it? i think that''s what would give it that "finishing touch"</td>', 'the lighting and colors create a really cool effect and mood. maybe you could add an unsharpen filter to it? i think that''s what would give it that "finishing touch"', '2004-09-28 18:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(929495, 107376, 24079, '<td valign="top">I''m really really loving this idea! I like how the pipes lead your eyes downward. The black and white combined with the shadows, contrast, and unique lighting make a really cool photograph. Only thing I really don''t like is at the top left hand corner where there is a black distracting empty space. Great job on this photo, I hope it does well in this challenge!</td>', 'I''m really really loving this idea! I like how the pipes lead your eyes downward. The black and white combined with the shadows, contrast, and unique lighting make a really cool photograph. Only thing I really don''t like is at the top left hand corner where there is a black distracting empty space. Great job on this photo, I hope it does well in this challenge!', '2004-09-28 18:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(929496, 108103, 24079, '<td valign="top">Ooo wow! I think this is a really good photo. Although, there is a distracting image to the bottom right that could be cropped out.</td>', 'Ooo wow! I think this is a really good photo. Although, there is a distracting image to the bottom right that could be cropped out.', '2004-09-28 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(929497, 107467, 24079, '<td valign="top">This photo fits well into the competition, but looks a little overexposed. Exellent idea!</td>', 'This photo fits well into the competition, but looks a little overexposed. Exellent idea!', '2004-09-28 18:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(929499, 107894, 24079, '<td valign="top">The web has too many distracting parts that aren''t exactly pleasing to the eye, but the spider attracts my eyes to the center, which I like. Good job.</td>', 'The web has too many distracting parts that aren''t exactly pleasing to the eye, but the spider attracts my eyes to the center, which I like. Good job.', '2004-09-28 18:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(929503, 108099, 24079, '<td valign="top">Wow. The photo has an almost eeyrie mood to it. I love the emotions this photo sparks! The background is just a tad distracting, although you did a great job.</td>', 'Wow. The photo has an almost eeyrie mood to it. I love the emotions this photo sparks! The background is just a tad distracting, although you did a great job.', '2004-09-28 18:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
