(929607, 108089, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a tad oversharpened for my taste but a great capture of a complex object which is brought home nicely in your title. :) Excellent image.</td>', 'This is a tad oversharpened for my taste but a great capture of a complex object which is brought home nicely in your title. :) Excellent image.', '2004-09-28 20:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
