(929638, 108109, 6349, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo.  One of my favorites in the challenge.  I really hope it does well.  Adding it to my favs now so I don''t forget.  10</td>', 'I LOVE this photo.  One of my favorites in the challenge.  I really hope it does well.  Adding it to my favs now so I don''t forget.  10', '2004-09-28 20:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(929640, 107537, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  One of my favorites in the challenge.  I expect that it will do very well.  10</td>', 'This is a great photo.  One of my favorites in the challenge.  I expect that it will do very well.  10', '2004-09-28 20:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(929642, 108071, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.', '2004-09-28 20:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(929645, 108078, 5792, '<td valign="top">The choice of B&amp;W is good for this image and the framing is fine. Objects with fine detail like this one easily suffer from oversharpening. This one is a little oversharpened and the fine detail is affected.</td>', 'The choice of B&W is good for this image and the framing is fine. Objects with fine detail like this one easily suffer from oversharpening. This one is a little oversharpened and the fine detail is affected.', '2004-09-28 20:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(929647, 107904, 6349, '<td valign="top">excellent image.  i expect this will do very well.  Not sure I like your composition but I have no doubt that it was fully intentional so i won''t get into it.  Besides that, the brightness in the upperleft is a little distracting although well exposed considering what the scene must have been like. 9</td>', 'excellent image.  i expect this will do very well.  Not sure I like your composition but I have no doubt that it was fully intentional so i won''t get into it.  Besides that, the brightness in the upperleft is a little distracting although well exposed considering what the scene must have been like. 9', '2004-09-28 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(929648, 107960, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  My favorite of the spiderwebs.  I would use something like this as a background for other projects.  10</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  My favorite of the spiderwebs.  I would use something like this as a background for other projects.  10', '2004-09-28 20:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(929653, 107753, 5792, '<td valign="top">The concept of this image is great for this challenge. The technical quality of the image is not so good. Oversharpening is visible as a halo on the border between the black dirt and light colored background. It is also planly visible on the uncut bulbs as well. It gives the image a digitalization quality that is distracting to the excellent concept.</td>', 'The concept of this image is great for this challenge. The technical quality of the image is not so good. Oversharpening is visible as a halo on the border between the black dirt and light colored background. It is also planly visible on the uncut bulbs as well. It gives the image a digitalization quality that is distracting to the excellent concept.', '2004-09-28 20:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(929657, 107479, 5792, '<td valign="top">For me the large amount of out-of-focus image on the left hand side is distracting.</td>', 'For me the large amount of out-of-focus image on the left hand side is distracting.', '2004-09-28 20:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(929658, 107965, 25742, '<td valign="top">I would have done this in motion.</td>', 'I would have done this in motion.', '2004-09-28 20:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
