(929676, 107963, 5792, '<td valign="top">This idea is similar to my own submission for this challenge. It looks like your camera was unable to capture the image properly under the low light conditions of the cavern. Detail clarity and subtle color distinctions got lost. My camera has trouble with that too. I suspect this looked a lot better in person.</td>', 'This idea is similar to my own submission for this challenge. It looks like your camera was unable to capture the image properly under the low light conditions of the cavern. Detail clarity and subtle color distinctions got lost. My camera has trouble with that too. I suspect this looked a lot better in person.', '2004-09-28 20:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(929701, 107809, 20539, '<td valign="top">this should score very high. you have my 10 =). its just what the challenge was asking for. good job</td>', 'this should score very high. you have my 10 =). its just what the challenge was asking for. good job', '2004-09-28 21:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
