(931218, 108109, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view of this photo as well as the composition. My only concern is its relation to the theme. The photo composition itself is not complex nor is the subject. I actually consider something routine as being the oposite of something complex. Then again, maybe my life is too simple. However, given the vaqueness of this challenge, I am not scoring based on meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I like the point of view of this photo as well as the composition. My only concern is its relation to the theme. The photo composition itself is not complex nor is the subject. I actually consider something routine as being the oposite of something complex. Then again, maybe my life is too simple. However, given the vaqueness of this challenge, I am not scoring based on meeting the challenge.', '2004-09-29 16:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(931270, 108018, 9089, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract look of this one, the colors and dimensions work to invite the viewer into the photo and make him linger wondering how it really is supposed to work.</td>', 'I like the abstract look of this one, the colors and dimensions work to invite the viewer into the photo and make him linger wondering how it really is supposed to work.', '2004-09-29 16:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(931274, 107287, 9089, '<td valign="top">Although not the most excellent photo in the world, I am still scoring it high because it is the only one that made me smile and like enough to call my wife in to see it.  Great perspective.</td>', 'Although not the most excellent photo in the world, I am still scoring it high because it is the only one that made me smile and like enough to call my wife in to see it.  Great perspective.', '2004-09-29 16:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(931291, 108080, 9089, '<td valign="top">Although the cockpit is very complex, the square on look, as well as the colors do not lend well to an eye-catching photograph.  Maybe a different angle/perspective would help.  The other thing that bothers me in the photo is the difference in the top right of the canopy compared to the top left canopy.  The bright glare draws my eye up to that corner.</td>', 'Although the cockpit is very complex, the square on look, as well as the colors do not lend well to an eye-catching photograph.  Maybe a different angle/perspective would help.  The other thing that bothers me in the photo is the difference in the top right of the canopy compared to the top left canopy.  The bright glare draws my eye up to that corner.', '2004-09-29 17:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(931297, 107963, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cave formations, however, it seems to be a bit blurry, and looks like there are lots of artifacts (especially on the columns to the right).  I''m guessing that you shot it handheld at a high iso, and then tried fixing it.  Good try at a difficult scene.</td>', 'Beautiful cave formations, however, it seems to be a bit blurry, and looks like there are lots of artifacts (especially on the columns to the right).  I''m guessing that you shot it handheld at a high iso, and then tried fixing it.  Good try at a difficult scene.', '2004-09-29 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(931307, 107338, 9089, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if others will like this shot, but I love it.  I keep coming back to it, trying to see if I can see anything in the reflection.  The grain as well as the darkness add to the image.  I could easily see this photo on the cover of some novel.</td>', 'I don''t know if others will like this shot, but I love it.  I keep coming back to it, trying to see if I can see anything in the reflection.  The grain as well as the darkness add to the image.  I could easily see this photo on the cover of some novel.', '2004-09-29 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(931312, 107745, 9089, '<td valign="top">Great capture of this moment in time.  I do think that this capture doesn''t do as well as it should because of the similarities of the colors across the whole picture, with nothing really standing out except for the brown leg and the pinpoint eye.  But the water, feathers, fish are all the same color, so my eyes are continually wandering without finding a place to rest (the eye is too small to hold interest for long).  Maybe a small border, or tighter crop on the head and fish would work better.</td>', 'Great capture of this moment in time.  I do think that this capture doesn''t do as well as it should because of the similarities of the colors across the whole picture, with nothing really standing out except for the brown leg and the pinpoint eye.  But the water, feathers, fish are all the same color, so my eyes are continually wandering without finding a place to rest (the eye is too small to hold interest for long).  Maybe a small border, or tighter crop on the head and fish would work better.', '2004-09-29 17:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(931315, 107739, 9089, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, unfortunately there is nothing there for me to understand exactly what it is, so my interest isn''t held any longer than asking "what is it?"</td>', 'Interesting photo, unfortunately there is nothing there for me to understand exactly what it is, so my interest isn''t held any longer than asking "what is it?"', '2004-09-29 17:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(931319, 108110, 9089, '<td valign="top">Good eye to see the pattern in this photo.  The lighting is good, but the uneven brightness/size of the lights detracts from the interesting architecture.</td>', 'Good eye to see the pattern in this photo.  The lighting is good, but the uneven brightness/size of the lights detracts from the interesting architecture.', '2004-09-29 17:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(931363, 107856, 9089, '<td valign="top">The photo seems like it is upside down to me.  With our eyes naturally going clockwise around, the pattern on the shell leads me right out the top of the photo.</td>', 'The photo seems like it is upside down to me.  With our eyes naturally going clockwise around, the pattern on the shell leads me right out the top of the photo.', '2004-09-29 17:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(931371, 107753, 9089, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture,  the onion doesn''t seem to be as sharp as it should be, that may be because of lighting issues, looking at the background, it goes from a brown to a eggshell white.  Would like to know how you did this though, it is a technique that would be interesting to copy.</td>', 'Interesting picture,  the onion doesn''t seem to be as sharp as it should be, that may be because of lighting issues, looking at the background, it goes from a brown to a eggshell white.  Would like to know how you did this though, it is a technique that would be interesting to copy.', '2004-09-29 17:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(931468, 108083, 10390, '<td valign="top">This sure is complex, but there''s nothing for the eye to stop for and the whole of the image isn''t interesting enough imo.  I like the colors.  It would be better if you would have had some leafs sharp in foreground, closer to the camera and used something like this as a background.</td>', 'This sure is complex, but there''s nothing for the eye to stop for and the whole of the image isn''t interesting enough imo.  I like the colors.  It would be better if you would have had some leafs sharp in foreground, closer to the camera and used something like this as a background.', '2004-09-29 18:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
