(931714, 106529, 22748, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel very photographic to me. Too much like a picture of a page in a textbook. I suppose that''s what it is? I need some more artistic elements.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel very photographic to me. Too much like a picture of a page in a textbook. I suppose that''s what it is? I need some more artistic elements.', '2004-09-29 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(931720, 107895, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very well done! So sharp and such great color. At first it didn''t seem to feel complex, but on second though, there are so many and so varied drops, especially tiny ones, that it really is a complex photograph. Cool. <br/> <br/>Although I KNOW you''ll get comments like ''the waterdrop effect is overdone'' this is a well executed shot. My only complaint really is the right side is kind of blurry compared to the left side which is really sharp. 7.</td>', 'Very well done! So sharp and such great color. At first it didn''t seem to feel complex, but on second though, there are so many and so varied drops, especially tiny ones, that it really is a complex photograph. Cool.  Although I KNOW you''ll get comments like ''the waterdrop effect is overdone'' this is a well executed shot. My only complaint really is the right side is kind of blurry compared to the left side which is really sharp. 7.', '2004-09-29 20:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
