(931758, 107973, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow. That''s all I can say. Such fabulous colors and textures. I''m thinking top 10 at least.</td>', 'Wow. That''s all I can say. Such fabulous colors and textures. I''m thinking top 10 at least.', '2004-09-29 21:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(931759, 108087, 22748, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice is that it''s a little grainy, as if it''s been resized badly, and also it''s kind of poorly lit. With a bit more even lighting to fill in some of the shadowy areas it would be better.</td>', 'The first thing I notice is that it''s a little grainy, as if it''s been resized badly, and also it''s kind of poorly lit. With a bit more even lighting to fill in some of the shadowy areas it would be better.', '2004-09-29 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(931764, 108080, 22748, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge! But it looks like it was taken with the camera''s builtin flash. Ugh.Flat, nasty lighting and harsh shadows and no textures. Next time try not using the flash, or find a way to bounce the flash.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge! But it looks like it was taken with the camera''s builtin flash. Ugh.Flat, nasty lighting and harsh shadows and no textures. Next time try not using the flash, or find a way to bounce the flash.', '2004-09-29 21:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
