(931946, 107598, 20539, '<td valign="top">when trying to accentuate poverty in a photo, its good to use grain to show some sort of sad-depressing mood. howerver i think in this particular photo, it would come out nicer if it were sharp as opposed to noisy. just because a lot of detail is involved. nice capture... and the b&amp;w looks great. is this indonesia?</td>', 'when trying to accentuate poverty in a photo, its good to use grain to show some sort of sad-depressing mood. howerver i think in this particular photo, it would come out nicer if it were sharp as opposed to noisy. just because a lot of detail is involved. nice capture... and the b&w looks great. is this indonesia?', '2004-09-29 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
