(931957, 107952, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good subject, good interesting camera angle.<br/> <br/>Bad flash. Bad, bad flash!! The lighting really ruins this otherwise fabulous photo. The direct on-camera flash makes for flat light that doesn''t show textures or shape, makes ugly shadows (for instance beind the coils of the big spiral coil at the bottom), and nasty glare like there is inside the case.</td>', 'Good subject, good interesting camera angle. Bad flash. Bad, bad flash!! The lighting really ruins this otherwise fabulous photo. The direct on-camera flash makes for flat light that doesn''t show textures or shape, makes ugly shadows (for instance beind the coils of the big spiral coil at the bottom), and nasty glare like there is inside the case.', '2004-09-29 23:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(931962, 107635, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool composition!! I love how the ring is in sharp focus and then it fades into the everlasting blur. I wonder what the background is we see through the hole?<br/> <br/>It seems not quite straight however. I would rotate clockwise a degree or so, so that the line in the centerwas completely vertical. These centered compositions are *exceedingly* demanding of perfection in framing and cropping.</td>', 'Cool composition!! I love how the ring is in sharp focus and then it fades into the everlasting blur. I wonder what the background is we see through the hole? It seems not quite straight however. I would rotate clockwise a degree or so, so that the line in the centerwas completely vertical. These centered compositions are *exceedingly* demanding of perfection in framing and cropping.', '2004-09-29 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(931965, 107745, 22748, '<td valign="top">Ooops, this must have been the wrong challenge, huh? Wildlife is *this* week, I think.<br/> <br/>Okay, it just really is not at ALL complex to me. A bird. In the water. With a fish. Somewhat blurry background increases the focus on the foreground subject and reduces the complexity. <br/> <br/>Still, this is a great photo! Is that a flounder? Fabulous image, but it makes me double-check which challenge I''m voting for.</td>', 'Ooops, this must have been the wrong challenge, huh? Wildlife is *this* week, I think. Okay, it just really is not at ALL complex to me. A bird. In the water. With a fish. Somewhat blurry background increases the focus on the foreground subject and reduces the complexity.  Still, this is a great photo! Is that a flounder? Fabulous image, but it makes me double-check which challenge I''m voting for.', '2004-09-29 23:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
