(932454, 106825, 19952, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of the ultra-closeup eye shots and this is a particularly good one.I think it would be better to see fewer items reflected in the eye so we can really see what they are, and that one gray vein is a bit distracting, but those are nitpicks for an overall excellent shot. Very nice job.</td>', 'I''m a big fan of the ultra-closeup eye shots and this is a particularly good one.I think it would be better to see fewer items reflected in the eye so we can really see what they are, and that one gray vein is a bit distracting, but those are nitpicks for an overall excellent shot. Very nice job.', '2004-09-30 09:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(932468, 107991, 26311, '<td valign="top">At Last!<br/>A photograph from somone who understands complexity. And  the beauty of perfection.<br/> <br/>I''ve been dutifully ploughing through and voting on the "simplistic and trivial"  presented here tonight and your wonderful image is the only one so far that demostrates to me ani intelligent interpretation of the theme.<br/> <br/>Well done for the idea, the interpretation of the theme, and the quality of the image.<br/> <br/>I''ll give this one a 10........or shuld it be 1.618?<br/> <br/></td>', 'At Last!A photograph from somone who understands complexity. And  the beauty of perfection. I''ve been dutifully ploughing through and voting on the "simplistic and trivial"  presented here tonight and your wonderful image is the only one so far that demostrates to me ani intelligent interpretation of the theme. Well done for the idea, the interpretation of the theme, and the quality of the image. I''ll give this one a 10........or shuld it be 1.618? ', '2004-09-30 09:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
