(932505, 107519, 5728, '<td valign="top">A suitable subject for the challenge for sure, however the lighting is unbalanced with more light coming from the right side leaving the left side, which contains the main complexity of the watch, is too dark.</td>', 'A suitable subject for the challenge for sure, however the lighting is unbalanced with more light coming from the right side leaving the left side, which contains the main complexity of the watch, is too dark.', '2004-09-30 10:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(932506, 107386, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good subject, I''m guessing The Netherlands or Germany for this one :) The perspective is good, however I would probably have changed the angle a little so that you only have the bikes in the frame and not that empty space in the top right corner.</td>', 'Good subject, I''m guessing The Netherlands or Germany for this one :) The perspective is good, however I would probably have changed the angle a little so that you only have the bikes in the frame and not that empty space in the top right corner.', '2004-09-30 10:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(932512, 107096, 5728, '<td valign="top">Taking a break from a killer day :) The B&amp;W works well, the graininess also comes over okay for me. It''s a little gruesome though which usually doesn''t work so well in DPC so I will be interested in seeing how this ends up. Also the tie to complexity might be a little too vague here.</td>', 'Taking a break from a killer day :) The B&W works well, the graininess also comes over okay for me. It''s a little gruesome though which usually doesn''t work so well in DPC so I will be interested in seeing how this ends up. Also the tie to complexity might be a little too vague here.', '2004-09-30 10:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(932517, 106642, 5728, '<td valign="top">It does depict complexity for sure, but the image itself doesn''t really have that kick to it which makes stand out from the pack. I probably wouldn''t have shot this straight on but chosen a different angle and definitely a different background.</td>', 'It does depict complexity for sure, but the image itself doesn''t really have that kick to it which makes stand out from the pack. I probably wouldn''t have shot this straight on but chosen a different angle and definitely a different background.', '2004-09-30 10:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(932518, 108067, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wowzers! This is fabulous. Brilliant composition. The lighting is great and I like the colors provided by the light coming through the circuit board. 9</td>', 'Wowzers! This is fabulous. Brilliant composition. The lighting is great and I like the colors provided by the light coming through the circuit board. 9', '2004-09-30 10:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(932527, 106529, 20375, '<td valign="top">Scratching my head on this. Hope there is a "how to" on this at some point.<br/>Excellent shot.</td>', 'Scratching my head on this. Hope there is a "how to" on this at some point.Excellent shot.', '2004-09-30 10:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(932528, 107909, 20375, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Love the colours. <br/>Nice centered composition.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Love the colours. Nice centered composition.', '2004-09-30 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(932529, 108110, 20375, '<td valign="top">Very original. Well done. Best of all the "web" shots.</td>', 'Very original. Well done. Best of all the "web" shots.', '2004-09-30 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
