(932535, 108016, 26361, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the colors and the pavement, as well as finished parts &amp; unfinished parts.  The border is distracting on the right.  Good shot.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the colors and the pavement, as well as finished parts & unfinished parts.  The border is distracting on the right.  Good shot.', '2004-09-30 11:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
