(932750, 107338, 16266, '<td valign="top">i think this is my fav photo of all. I really like the mood and the reflection.  It has a 50''s feel to it. nice burning nice colors...... great image. I hope it does well...</td>', 'i think this is my fav photo of all. I really like the mood and the reflection.  It has a 50''s feel to it. nice burning nice colors...... great image. I hope it does well...', '2004-09-30 14:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
