(933929, 108103, 27472, '<td valign="top">Great image of Shockwave at Paramount''s Kings Dominion.</td>', 'Great image of Shockwave at Paramount''s Kings Dominion.', '2004-10-01 06:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934028, 106529, 6912, '<td valign="top">Wow, if this one has really been validated, it has to be the winner, what an amazing idea! 10+++</td>', 'Wow, if this one has really been validated, it has to be the winner, what an amazing idea! 10+++', '2004-10-01 08:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(934089, 106553, 16636, '<td valign="top">probably the best circuit photo from a common theme - well done</td>', 'probably the best circuit photo from a common theme - well done', '2004-10-01 08:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(934097, 107830, 16636, '<td valign="top">well composed and great colours</td>', 'well composed and great colours', '2004-10-01 08:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(934105, 107637, 16636, '<td valign="top">what a wonderful image you have created from such a simple object, well done and one of my favourutes - 10</td>', 'what a wonderful image you have created from such a simple object, well done and one of my favourutes - 10', '2004-10-01 09:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(934137, 107096, 22748, '<td valign="top">Ok, wow. This made me stop to look at it longer. Very unique. I''m not sure what it is exactly. Is it blood on the person? I usually hate grain in photos, but I really like the way it''s done here. The tones and textures in this shot are great. Altogether still very mysterious feeling. I''ll be interested to see what other people see in this image, and what the photog''s vision is.</td>', 'Ok, wow. This made me stop to look at it longer. Very unique. I''m not sure what it is exactly. Is it blood on the person? I usually hate grain in photos, but I really like the way it''s done here. The tones and textures in this shot are great. Altogether still very mysterious feeling. I''ll be interested to see what other people see in this image, and what the photog''s vision is.', '2004-10-01 09:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(934143, 107774, 22748, '<td valign="top">Not a particularly interesting composition. Too centered, "let''s just fit the subject in the frame and snap away", etc. Definitely looks like a snapshot.  I would maybe get in close and focus on a smaller part of the machine. There''s plenty of complexity there to capture.</td>', 'Not a particularly interesting composition. Too centered, "let''s just fit the subject in the frame and snap away", etc. Definitely looks like a snapshot.  I would maybe get in close and focus on a smaller part of the machine. There''s plenty of complexity there to capture.', '2004-10-01 09:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(934162, 107571, 749, '<td valign="top">First impressions - what the heck is it? I''m guessing a macro of a roll of wickerwork, or some sort of knotted fabric. The focus is a bit odd - I''m not sure if it''s a fuzzy subject or a blurry photo that''s been sharpened - but it combines with the spiral shape to make it vaguely hypnotic, nice. Couple of suggestions - the colour seems a bit muted - did you try boosting the saturation or hue shifting to another colour? Also, I''d recommend you try cropping closer so that the spiral''s centre isn''t central in the image, ie have it over one of the Rule of Thirds points, as that often helps lead the eye around the image. Overall, an interesting image that feels a bit too soft and muted, but definitely meets the challenge - 6.</td>', 'First impressions - what the heck is it? I''m guessing a macro of a roll of wickerwork, or some sort of knotted fabric. The focus is a bit odd - I''m not sure if it''s a fuzzy subject or a blurry photo that''s been sharpened - but it combines with the spiral shape to make it vaguely hypnotic, nice. Couple of suggestions - the colour seems a bit muted - did you try boosting the saturation or hue shifting to another colour? Also, I''d recommend you try cropping closer so that the spiral''s centre isn''t central in the image, ie have it over one of the Rule of Thirds points, as that often helps lead the eye around the image. Overall, an interesting image that feels a bit too soft and muted, but definitely meets the challenge - 6.', '2004-10-01 09:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(934177, 108104, 22748, '<td valign="top">Yuck, somebody needs a shave. :) No, seriously, this is pretty creative. The lighting is rather dramatic and interesting too. I might prefer to not have the highlight on the edge, because it draws the eye out of the composition instead of letting the eye follow the spiral.</td>', 'Yuck, somebody needs a shave. :) No, seriously, this is pretty creative. The lighting is rather dramatic and interesting too. I might prefer to not have the highlight on the edge, because it draws the eye out of the composition instead of letting the eye follow the spiral.', '2004-10-01 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(934179, 108018, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice colors! That''s the first thing I notice about this image. Also, the lighting and textures make it feel really three-dimensional. Beautiful.<br/></td>', 'Wow, nice colors! That''s the first thing I notice about this image. Also, the lighting and textures make it feel really three-dimensional. Beautiful.', '2004-10-01 10:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
