(936770, 107911, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have done this image. What I am not sure about is the focus point of this image - then again, I don''t really understand how these things work. Love the contrast and tonality of the image. Should have cleaned the bits of dust :) 9</td>', 'I like the way you have done this image. What I am not sure about is the focus point of this image - then again, I don''t really understand how these things work. Love the contrast and tonality of the image. Should have cleaned the bits of dust :) 9', '2004-10-02 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
