(936785, 106818, 27524, '<td valign="top">I like light and dark parts of that art... gives good contrast. Good compozition aswell. Good luck!</td>', 'I like light and dark parts of that art... gives good contrast. Good compozition aswell. Good luck!', '2004-10-02 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(936787, 107773, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its good picture and awsome colors but but tight focus doesnt show much of complexity.</td>', 'Its good picture and awsome colors but but tight focus doesnt show much of complexity.', '2004-10-02 12:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(936896, 107922, 8891, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the hammers being shot in motion but I feel that they are distracting. I might have wrok with an angle showing more of them and no motion perhaps. Not certain. Do like the colors and the composition of the rest.</td>', 'I appreciate the hammers being shot in motion but I feel that they are distracting. I might have wrok with an angle showing more of them and no motion perhaps. Not certain. Do like the colors and the composition of the rest.', '2004-10-02 13:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(936943, 107650, 22734, '<td valign="top">Though not as complex as I would like it for this challenge, this is a design complex composition with beautiful delicate lines and clever in presentation. Bumping up</td>', 'Though not as complex as I would like it for this challenge, this is a design complex composition with beautiful delicate lines and clever in presentation. Bumping up', '2004-10-02 13:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(936949, 107691, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on this challenge with very cool color. Okay, here we are faced with the complexity of the human being, the souls seeking attention and converastion and doing it with the use of alcohol to remove many of the guards that we employ to conserve our privacy. Well, this is one take. Bumping up</td>', 'A very interesting take on this challenge with very cool color. Okay, here we are faced with the complexity of the human being, the souls seeking attention and converastion and doing it with the use of alcohol to remove many of the guards that we employ to conserve our privacy. Well, this is one take. Bumping up', '2004-10-02 14:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
