(937318, 107747, 20364, '<td valign="top">I came back around to comment and decided to bump this from an 8 to a 9.  Very nice photo that fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'I came back around to comment and decided to bump this from an 8 to a 9.  Very nice photo that fits the challenge perfectly.', '2004-10-02 16:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(937395, 107809, 22734, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and certainly very complex. Too complicated to follow the veins of these pipes. Bumping up.</td>', 'Fascinating and certainly very complex. Too complicated to follow the veins of these pipes. Bumping up.', '2004-10-02 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(937397, 108031, 22734, '<td valign="top">Yes, nothing more simpler and complicated than mother nature. You selected and photographed well one of her specimens. Bumping up.</td>', 'Yes, nothing more simpler and complicated than mother nature. You selected and photographed well one of her specimens. Bumping up.', '2004-10-02 17:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(937405, 107739, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice selection for this challenge. it brings beautiful color and a natutral complexity that no one can really explain. Nature is amazing.</td>', 'Very nice selection for this challenge. it brings beautiful color and a natutral complexity that no one can really explain. Nature is amazing.', '2004-10-02 17:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(937422, 107525, 19936, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, patters and depth of field here.  Great job.  Certainly meets the complexity subject.</td>', 'I love the colors, patters and depth of field here.  Great job.  Certainly meets the complexity subject.', '2004-10-02 18:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(937423, 107973, 19936, '<td valign="top">Another shot that has great color, clarity and depth of field.  The smoothness of the lines and shapes add interest.  I rate this a 10.</td>', 'Another shot that has great color, clarity and depth of field.  The smoothness of the lines and shapes add interest.  I rate this a 10.', '2004-10-02 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(937426, 107780, 19936, '<td valign="top">One of my two 10''s, simple but complex.  Sounds confusing don''t it?  Great composition.</td>', 'One of my two 10''s, simple but complex.  Sounds confusing don''t it?  Great composition.', '2004-10-02 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(937428, 106825, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  The windowed reflection adds the notion of complexity and the title opens up the viewer to the complex nature of the human mind.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a great shot!  The windowed reflection adds the notion of complexity and the title opens up the viewer to the complex nature of the human mind.  Great job.', '2004-10-02 18:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(937430, 107331, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait.  You captured a very teasing look and cropped well to highlihgt it.  Good job.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait.  You captured a very teasing look and cropped well to highlihgt it.  Good job.', '2004-10-02 18:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(937431, 108023, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I can feel the depth.  The puffy clouds add drama to the horizon.</td>', 'Great shot!  I can feel the depth.  The puffy clouds add drama to the horizon.', '2004-10-02 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(937433, 108069, 19936, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of a "daughter".  Oh so complex.  Good job.</td>', 'Perfect capture of a "daughter".  Oh so complex.  Good job.', '2004-10-02 18:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(937436, 107650, 19936, '<td valign="top">Definitely complex.  Good detail and clarity.  For me I think it would have been better with a closer crop and without the grooms arms in it.  But hey, Im an average 5.0 guy.</td>', 'Definitely complex.  Good detail and clarity.  For me I think it would have been better with a closer crop and without the grooms arms in it.  But hey, Im an average 5.0 guy.', '2004-10-02 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(937442, 107292, 19936, '<td valign="top">This shot does not speak to the complexity of the apparent subject.  Sorry, but it is otherwise pretty bland for me.  Maybe you could try a more detailed shot of the computer innards like some of the others entered in this challenge.  Keep trying and good luck.</td>', 'This shot does not speak to the complexity of the apparent subject.  Sorry, but it is otherwise pretty bland for me.  Maybe you could try a more detailed shot of the computer innards like some of the others entered in this challenge.  Keep trying and good luck.', '2004-10-02 18:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(937443, 108109, 19936, '<td valign="top">I get what youre trying to say here but it just does not do it for me.  Unless I knew the subject I would never have guessed this shot represented complexity.  Sorry but it just does not have any pizzazz.</td>', 'I get what youre trying to say here but it just does not do it for me.  Unless I knew the subject I would never have guessed this shot represented complexity.  Sorry but it just does not have any pizzazz.', '2004-10-02 18:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(937445, 107096, 19936, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but this look contrived to me.  It just does not bring out the true laborer.  Good photo though and of course, it is just one guys opinion.  Good luck.</td>', 'I don''t know why but this look contrived to me.  It just does not bring out the true laborer.  Good photo though and of course, it is just one guys opinion.  Good luck.', '2004-10-02 18:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(937449, 106581, 19936, '<td valign="top">For me anyway I think the lighting takes away from this shot.  Maybe either a more uniform shadow or wait till it is in full light?  Even a closer crop of just a portion of the face might have been an improvement.  Keep trying (like me the 5.0 guy) and good luck.</td>', 'For me anyway I think the lighting takes away from this shot.  Maybe either a more uniform shadow or wait till it is in full light?  Even a closer crop of just a portion of the face might have been an improvement.  Keep trying (like me the 5.0 guy) and good luck.', '2004-10-02 18:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(937454, 107598, 19936, '<td valign="top">Now this shot speaks complexity to me, great subject with much emption.  I think technically it could be better and would have scored higher from me had it been a little sharper and maybe cropped closer to the shanty town.  Good job overall.</td>', 'Now this shot speaks complexity to me, great subject with much emption.  I think technically it could be better and would have scored higher from me had it been a little sharper and maybe cropped closer to the shanty town.  Good job overall.', '2004-10-02 18:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
