(937499, 108099, 22734, '<td valign="top">This may not have been your best choice for this comment. It opens up a can of worms. Namely, is faith complex? Is the way to salvation complex? Some will argue that faith is not complex at all and that the way to the lord is simple. However, I see complexity in the philosophical discussion. More so on the metaphysical nut I doubt other voters will take time to reflect. Bumping up yo 7 because you did a wonderful job here.</td>', 'This may not have been your best choice for this comment. It opens up a can of worms. Namely, is faith complex? Is the way to salvation complex? Some will argue that faith is not complex at all and that the way to the lord is simple. However, I see complexity in the philosophical discussion. More so on the metaphysical nut I doubt other voters will take time to reflect. Bumping up yo 7 because you did a wonderful job here.', '2004-10-02 19:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
