(937925, 107693, 9089, '<td valign="top">While the pattern is complex, there is nothing in the picture for me to really focus my eyes on, leaving a somewhat bland combnation of brown colors. Exposure is pretty much right on.  It is difficult to get a lot of detail on digital shots that have a lot of intricate patterns (especially when you have to compress the shots), this means that the pinecones don''t hold any interest except to make a person wonder if they are droppings or pine cones.</td>', 'While the pattern is complex, there is nothing in the picture for me to really focus my eyes on, leaving a somewhat bland combnation of brown colors. Exposure is pretty much right on.  It is difficult to get a lot of detail on digital shots that have a lot of intricate patterns (especially when you have to compress the shots), this means that the pinecones don''t hold any interest except to make a person wonder if they are droppings or pine cones.', '2004-10-03 02:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(937927, 107454, 9089, '<td valign="top">When looking for my entry I actually shot a rollercoaster track that looked somewhat like this.  However, I rejected it because it didn''t really focus my attention on the picture, rather seemed to be just a jumble of lines.  Here you have a jumble of branches, but nothing to focus my attention except the brown out of focus leaf at the bottom (which is emphasized as well by the border line).  The straight branch on the right going up, also draws a lot of attention away from the actual jumple in the middle.</td>', 'When looking for my entry I actually shot a rollercoaster track that looked somewhat like this.  However, I rejected it because it didn''t really focus my attention on the picture, rather seemed to be just a jumble of lines.  Here you have a jumble of branches, but nothing to focus my attention except the brown out of focus leaf at the bottom (which is emphasized as well by the border line).  The straight branch on the right going up, also draws a lot of attention away from the actual jumple in the middle.', '2004-10-03 02:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(937929, 107467, 9089, '<td valign="top">Good eye on seeing what could be an interesting picture in the ordinary.  I think had this been a ''textures'' this picture would do better, especially if it cut off the bottom right and top left that weren''t part of the ''pattern'', as it is, those two parts being different tend to draw my eyes to those corners and away from the pattern you were trying to focus on.  Contrast also seems a little harsh.</td>', 'Good eye on seeing what could be an interesting picture in the ordinary.  I think had this been a ''textures'' this picture would do better, especially if it cut off the bottom right and top left that weren''t part of the ''pattern'', as it is, those two parts being different tend to draw my eyes to those corners and away from the pattern you were trying to focus on.  Contrast also seems a little harsh.', '2004-10-03 02:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(937930, 107904, 9089, '<td valign="top">The picture leaves me with a feeling of incompleteness, there is something here that I''m not seeing.  I think part of the problem is that I get a feeling that the picture is falling over to the left.  Maybe a slight rotation clockwise would help.  It may also be that I am wanting to see stuff a little farther down,  the focus seems to be on the supposed line between the ceiling and the walls, with not enough of either to be really interesting.</td>', 'The picture leaves me with a feeling of incompleteness, there is something here that I''m not seeing.  I think part of the problem is that I get a feeling that the picture is falling over to the left.  Maybe a slight rotation clockwise would help.  It may also be that I am wanting to see stuff a little farther down,  the focus seems to be on the supposed line between the ceiling and the walls, with not enough of either to be really interesting.', '2004-10-03 02:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(937931, 107458, 9089, '<td valign="top">The lens flare on this picture helps to add emphasis to it, but unfortunately the location of the flare being right on the edge of the photo, with the flares pointing right to it, makes the eye jump off the picture.</td>', 'The lens flare on this picture helps to add emphasis to it, but unfortunately the location of the flare being right on the edge of the photo, with the flares pointing right to it, makes the eye jump off the picture.', '2004-10-03 02:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(937932, 107809, 10268, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty wicked.  Awesome colors.  <br/> <br/>My eyes wander all over the photo, though.  So I think a clear focal point would help out, but regardless, this is awesome.  9.</td>', 'That''s pretty wicked.  Awesome colors.   My eyes wander all over the photo, though.  So I think a clear focal point would help out, but regardless, this is awesome.  9.', '2004-10-03 02:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
