(938538, 107963, 19608, '<td valign="top">Simple yet very complex.  The white traingle on the bottom edge is a bit hot.  Great study in form and texture.</td>', 'Simple yet very complex.  The white traingle on the bottom edge is a bit hot.  Great study in form and texture.', '2004-10-03 13:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(938546, 107471, 19608, '<td valign="top">Definitely complex and great lighting to boot.  It seems to be oing downhill from left to right - which is ok, but would probably be more effectice going uphill.  Sky is great.</td>', 'Definitely complex and great lighting to boot.  It seems to be oing downhill from left to right - which is ok, but would probably be more effectice going uphill.  Sky is great.', '2004-10-03 13:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(938549, 108089, 19608, '<td valign="top">Complex and colorful as well.  It is really pristine!  Gone are the days of the flathead 6 and the backyard mechanic. Nicely done.</td>', 'Complex and colorful as well.  It is really pristine!  Gone are the days of the flathead 6 and the backyard mechanic. Nicely done.', '2004-10-03 13:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(938553, 107895, 22781, '<td valign="top">No matter that it looks like something we all know (and love)(I bet you''ve got lot''s of comments on that)<br/>This is a great picture...</td>', 'No matter that it looks like something we all know (and love)(I bet you''ve got lot''s of comments on that)This is a great picture...', '2004-10-03 13:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(938554, 107382, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not exact;y sure what it is - but t does not matter.  It is indeed very complex and shot very well.  The formal, centered composition works fine for me.  The tonal range is right on - crisp whites and deep blacks.</td>', 'Not exact;y sure what it is - but t does not matter.  It is indeed very complex and shot very well.  The formal, centered composition works fine for me.  The tonal range is right on - crisp whites and deep blacks.', '2004-10-03 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(938555, 107912, 22781, '<td valign="top">I see an elephant</td>', 'I see an elephant', '2004-10-03 13:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(938562, 107637, 19608, '<td valign="top">A cousin to the nautillus - and a great find.  I like the placement in the frame and the lighting.  To improve it a) remove the carrot colored and shape on the right side, b) remove the white line in the border - ending only with a thin black line.  The colors and the blurriness of the background work well to contrast the shell.</td>', 'A cousin to the nautillus - and a great find.  I like the placement in the frame and the lighting.  To improve it a) remove the carrot colored and shape on the right side, b) remove the white line in the border - ending only with a thin black line.  The colors and the blurriness of the background work well to contrast the shell.', '2004-10-03 13:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(938566, 107535, 19608, '<td valign="top">It is indeed very intricate and works well in the monotone.  A bit too soft in spots and the man-made grid of (fence?) at the bottom is out of place.</td>', 'It is indeed very intricate and works well in the monotone.  A bit too soft in spots and the man-made grid of (fence?) at the bottom is out of place.', '2004-10-03 13:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(938574, 107648, 19608, '<td valign="top">Fall colors are a complex story for sure.  The image is very busy making it difficult to find a true center of interest.  The red line in the border, although small, does not help the image.</td>', 'Fall colors are a complex story for sure.  The image is very busy making it difficult to find a true center of interest.  The red line in the border, although small, does not help the image.', '2004-10-03 13:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(938577, 107745, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures on the bird - subdues lighting really worked well.</td>', 'Wonderful textures on the bird - subdues lighting really worked well.', '2004-10-03 13:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(938584, 107829, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very unusual concept - but it works well,  The "ghosts" add some mystery.  Lighting is very effective.  Border is hideous.</td>', 'A very unusual concept - but it works well,  The "ghosts" add some mystery.  Lighting is very effective.  Border is hideous.', '2004-10-03 13:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938586, 108088, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - but would have worked better in the card was parallel to the film plane.  This shot demands focus throughout.</td>', 'Nice idea - but would have worked better in the card was parallel to the film plane.  This shot demands focus throughout.', '2004-10-03 13:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(938600, 107454, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have very complex lines and shapes, - so it fits the challenge just fine.  The brown leaf at the bottom and the oof trees at the bottom are very distracting.  The brown line border attempt is rather crude.  I love the splashes of green at the top.</td>', 'You have very complex lines and shapes, - so it fits the challenge just fine.  The brown leaf at the bottom and the oof trees at the bottom are very distracting.  The brown line border attempt is rather crude.  I love the splashes of green at the top.', '2004-10-03 14:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(938602, 107739, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very blue and complex.  Nice study in texture.  Title is a joke (right?)</td>', 'Very blue and complex.  Nice study in texture.  Title is a joke (right?)', '2004-10-03 14:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(938605, 108027, 14819, '<td valign="top">nice texture</td>', 'nice texture', '2004-10-03 14:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(938606, 108075, 19608, '<td valign="top">It may not be that complex - but wow - what a scene.  The silhouettes and the sky are awesome.  Horizon is a tad off level - but easily fixed.</td>', 'It may not be that complex - but wow - what a scene.  The silhouettes and the sky are awesome.  Horizon is a tad off level - but easily fixed.', '2004-10-03 14:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(938608, 107623, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and mice nacro work.  The colors are perfect with the black background.</td>', 'Great lighting and mice nacro work.  The colors are perfect with the black background.', '2004-10-03 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(938611, 107912, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get the idea or the title.  The scene is pleasant, exposure is right on.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get the idea or the title.  The scene is pleasant, exposure is right on.', '2004-10-03 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938616, 107998, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very unusual.  I don''t know whether its a "real" thing or not, but it doesn''t matter.  Great colors.  Image is a biot too busy in the upper right, but the lower left is a perfect counter-balance.  White border is a bit heavy.</td>', 'Very unusual.  I don''t know whether its a "real" thing or not, but it doesn''t matter.  Great colors.  Image is a biot too busy in the upper right, but the lower left is a perfect counter-balance.  White border is a bit heavy.', '2004-10-03 14:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(938620, 108083, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful indeed.  It''s busy - but that works for this tapestry.</td>', 'Beautiful indeed.  It''s busy - but that works for this tapestry.', '2004-10-03 14:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(938622, 107626, 1368, '<td valign="top">grat composition the fog add mystic to this shot one of the best in this challenge - 10</td>', 'grat composition the fog add mystic to this shot one of the best in this challenge - 10', '2004-10-03 14:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(938623, 107973, 1368, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing! the lighting and colors are just perfect!</td>', 'Simply amazing! the lighting and colors are just perfect!', '2004-10-03 14:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(938636, 107922, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The red band of (felt?) adds a superb compositional element.  Exposure right on.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The red band of (felt?) adds a superb compositional element.  Exposure right on.', '2004-10-03 14:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(938638, 107832, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hours and hours of frustration.  The white backgroud is perfect for the colored cubes.</td>', 'Hours and hours of frustration.  The white backgroud is perfect for the colored cubes.', '2004-10-03 14:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(938640, 107390, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Definitely complex.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Definitely complex.', '2004-10-03 14:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(938643, 107287, 19608, '<td valign="top">hehe.  An extra point for humor.  Seems a bit crowded - especially around the dog''s head - needs more space.  Colors work perfectly.</td>', 'hehe.  An extra point for humor.  Seems a bit crowded - especially around the dog''s head - needs more space.  Colors work perfectly.', '2004-10-03 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(938647, 107260, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s not exacly complex - but close enough to fit the challenge.  You have a stunning scene - perfectly exposed and composed.  Then you overpowered it by placing that overdone border around it.  I often comment on borders but very seldom deduct points for them - this is an exception.</td>', 'It''s not exacly complex - but close enough to fit the challenge.  You have a stunning scene - perfectly exposed and composed.  Then you overpowered it by placing that overdone border around it.  I often comment on borders but very seldom deduct points for them - this is an exception.', '2004-10-03 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(938650, 107991, 19608, '<td valign="top">Macro heaven - well done.  The dark colors of the center are perfect with the pastels radiating outside.  Composition is excellent.  Border works.</td>', 'Macro heaven - well done.  The dark colors of the center are perfect with the pastels radiating outside.  Composition is excellent.  Border works.', '2004-10-03 14:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(938660, 107893, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and great colors.  My only complaint is with the white part of the border.  The thin black line would have been perfect.  It is very strong as is, but try cropping the bottom so that the base  is about 1/2 way up the slanted spears.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and great colors.  My only complaint is with the white part of the border.  The thin black line would have been perfect.  It is very strong as is, but try cropping the bottom so that the base  is about 1/2 way up the slanted spears.', '2004-10-03 14:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(938662, 107096, 19608, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge - it doesn''t shout "complex" exactly, but close enough.  Black and white is well printed.  Unusual to say the least.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge - it doesn''t shout "complex" exactly, but close enough.  Black and white is well printed.  Unusual to say the least.', '2004-10-03 14:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(938665, 108007, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your idea was sound, but your exposure meter let you down.  The over-exposed area on the right is terrible.  The bark itself is not so bad - but still a bit over exposed.</td>', 'Your idea was sound, but your exposure meter let you down.  The over-exposed area on the right is terrible.  The bark itself is not so bad - but still a bit over exposed.', '2004-10-03 14:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(938667, 107376, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great pattern that works well in b&amp;w.  Border holds it all together nicely.</td>', 'Great pattern that works well in b&w.  Border holds it all together nicely.', '2004-10-03 14:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(938673, 107985, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like the watch a lot.  Exposure is perfect.  The background has white spots that would look good if they were "star looking" - but as is, they detract.  It would proably have been best of the background was pure black.</td>', 'I like the watch a lot.  Exposure is perfect.  The background has white spots that would look good if they were "star looking" - but as is, they detract.  It would proably have been best of the background was pure black.', '2004-10-03 14:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(938675, 107840, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lacy, artisty, and indeed complex.  It doesn''t need the heavy white border.</td>', 'Lacy, artisty, and indeed complex.  It doesn''t need the heavy white border.', '2004-10-03 14:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(938678, 107596, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great and impressive capture with lovely lighting choice. bumping up.</td>', 'A great and impressive capture with lovely lighting choice. bumping up.', '2004-10-03 14:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(938680, 107973, 19608, '<td valign="top">Antelope Canyon near Page I presume - an awesome location.  The long exposure is pefect and stable. Composition works well too.</td>', 'Antelope Canyon near Page I presume - an awesome location.  The long exposure is pefect and stable. Composition works well too.', '2004-10-03 14:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(938682, 107843, 19608, '<td valign="top">An excellent collection of nature''s colors.  Flat lighting was your friend.</td>', 'An excellent collection of nature''s colors.  Flat lighting was your friend.', '2004-10-03 14:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(938721, 108101, 19608, '<td valign="top">Full of WOW!  You did it all right - superb composition, perfect exposure, and inspired selection of subject.  I hear the ribbon train coming in your direction.</td>', 'Full of WOW!  You did it all right - superb composition, perfect exposure, and inspired selection of subject.  I hear the ribbon train coming in your direction.', '2004-10-03 15:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(938723, 107747, 19608, '<td valign="top">100 PERFECT time of day for this magic scene.  If you don''t ribbon - I will be amazed.  Congratulations.</td>', '100 PERFECT time of day for this magic scene.  If you don''t ribbon - I will be amazed.  Congratulations.', '2004-10-03 15:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(938728, 107895, 19608, '<td valign="top">Oh my - so welll done.  My second or so challenge was the same technique.  I hope you don''t get beat about the way I was.  I was accused of stealing, being unimaginative and nearly inhuman!    The introducion of the yellow color is a great touch.  I hope you do well - good luck.</td>', 'Oh my - so welll done.  My second or so challenge was the same technique.  I hope you don''t get beat about the way I was.  I was accused of stealing, being unimaginative and nearly inhuman!    The introducion of the yellow color is a great touch.  I hope you do well - good luck.', '2004-10-03 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(938730, 107856, 19608, '<td valign="top">A marvelous shot.  The colors are great as is the composition and exposure.  Superb find.</td>', 'A marvelous shot.  The colors are great as is the composition and exposure.  Superb find.', '2004-10-03 15:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(938789, 107953, 9089, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shape on the crystal.  Wish there was something in the picture to give me a sense of scale on it.  I would also give it a tighter crop.</td>', 'Fascinating shape on the crystal.  Wish there was something in the picture to give me a sense of scale on it.  I would also give it a tighter crop.', '2004-10-03 16:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(938812, 107893, 4517, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. 10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. 10', '2004-10-03 16:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(938820, 107747, 4517, '<td valign="top">Incredible view. If it was darker with more contrast and a touch more saturation it would stand out more. 8</td>', 'Incredible view. If it was darker with more contrast and a touch more saturation it would stand out more. 8', '2004-10-03 16:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(938862, 106825, 6532, '<td valign="top">My top pick!  I like the detail of the eye... wow!!  Good job!</td>', 'My top pick!  I like the detail of the eye... wow!!  Good job!', '2004-10-03 17:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(938863, 107607, 6532, '<td valign="top">Definitely the best spider web in the challenge - imo!  Good job!  One of my top picks.<br/></td>', 'Definitely the best spider web in the challenge - imo!  Good job!  One of my top picks.', '2004-10-03 17:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(938870, 108100, 6532, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping on this - very effective.</td>', 'I like the cropping on this - very effective.', '2004-10-03 17:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(939017, 108016, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting out-of-the-box border effect works pretty well with your colorful subject.</td>', 'Interesting out-of-the-box border effect works pretty well with your colorful subject.', '2004-10-03 18:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(939022, 108100, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast in archtectural styles; If I''d been smart enough to take this I''d probably have titled it <b>Yin/Yang</b></td>', 'Excellent contrast in archtectural styles; If I''d been smart enough to take this I''d probably have titled it Yin/Yang', '2004-10-03 18:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(939023, 108099, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting/adjustment to hide the cross in the trees and isolate the figure, adding a layer of complexity the composition, in addition to the subject.</td>', 'Excellent lighting/adjustment to hide the cross in the trees and isolate the figure, adding a layer of complexity the composition, in addition to the subject.', '2004-10-03 18:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(939026, 107287, 6104, '<td valign="top">haha, very clever.  I like it!</td>', 'haha, very clever.  I like it!', '2004-10-03 18:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(939096, 107382, 12962, '<td valign="top">Chihuly?  B/W is a different rendering definitely ...</td>', 'Chihuly?  B/W is a different rendering definitely ...', '2004-10-03 20:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(939097, 107571, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful ... color and shadows impart some kind of mysticism ... I give this a ten.</td>', 'This is really beautiful ... color and shadows impart some kind of mysticism ... I give this a ten.', '2004-10-03 20:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(939099, 107895, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice rendering of a tired technique and subject.</td>', 'Nice rendering of a tired technique and subject.', '2004-10-03 20:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(939102, 107650, 25464, '<td valign="top">Not exactly what I could see hanging on anyones wall, but well taken, beautiful color, complex both on the surface and underneath since I am assuming this is a wedding shot.  I could see this being a treasured photo displayed on the wall of the couple portrayed.  Lovely. 10.</td>', 'Not exactly what I could see hanging on anyones wall, but well taken, beautiful color, complex both on the surface and underneath since I am assuming this is a wedding shot.  I could see this being a treasured photo displayed on the wall of the couple portrayed.  Lovely. 10.', '2004-10-03 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(939103, 107092, 12962, '<td valign="top">I love this representation of complexity.  There''s a very slight chromatic aberration (purple fringing) around some of the white parts especially at the top - you can''t do anything about it because it might be inherent to the lens of your camera but you can certainly reduce it in post processing.  You can google for purple fringing.</td>', 'I love this representation of complexity.  There''s a very slight chromatic aberration (purple fringing) around some of the white parts especially at the top - you can''t do anything about it because it might be inherent to the lens of your camera but you can certainly reduce it in post processing.  You can google for purple fringing.', '2004-10-03 20:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(939106, 108075, 12962, '<td valign="top">That is like a movie backdrop.  Silhouettes are gorgeous.  So is the sky.</td>', 'That is like a movie backdrop.  Silhouettes are gorgeous.  So is the sky.', '2004-10-03 20:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(939110, 107941, 12962, '<td valign="top">The highlighting of the spider is incredible.</td>', 'The highlighting of the spider is incredible.', '2004-10-03 20:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(939114, 107453, 12962, '<td valign="top">Cool cool cooolors.  Love the neon treatment ... makes this complex circuitry looks simple.</td>', 'Cool cool cooolors.  Love the neon treatment ... makes this complex circuitry looks simple.', '2004-10-03 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(939116, 107946, 12962, '<td valign="top">Contact!  I expect Jodie Foster to suddenly come into the picture.  Beautiful capture - your were so lucky and patient to wait for the perfect moment to achieve this - movement of clouds, lighting are exquisite  Certainly meets the challenge in my book.</td>', 'Contact!  I expect Jodie Foster to suddenly come into the picture.  Beautiful capture - your were so lucky and patient to wait for the perfect moment to achieve this - movement of clouds, lighting are exquisite  Certainly meets the challenge in my book.', '2004-10-03 20:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(939118, 107953, 12962, '<td valign="top">Yeah!  Complexity very well illustrated.</td>', 'Yeah!  Complexity very well illustrated.', '2004-10-03 20:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(939120, 108071, 12962, '<td valign="top">Don''t want to sound oxymoronic but this simple composition conveys the essence of complexity :-).  Very graceful, if I may add.</td>', 'Don''t want to sound oxymoronic but this simple composition conveys the essence of complexity :-).  Very graceful, if I may add.', '2004-10-03 20:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(939122, 107214, 12962, '<td valign="top">I am a klutz ... sometimes gadgets like this can be complex to me.  Good job!</td>', 'I am a klutz ... sometimes gadgets like this can be complex to me.  Good job!', '2004-10-03 20:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(939126, 108099, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Whatever you did in post processing or in camera is definitly worth the effort.  Hope you will enumerate the steps after the challenge.  Faith could be complex.  The background trees are certainly complex.</td>', 'Wow.  Whatever you did in post processing or in camera is definitly worth the effort.  Hope you will enumerate the steps after the challenge.  Faith could be complex.  The background trees are certainly complex.', '2004-10-03 20:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(939128, 108091, 12962, '<td valign="top">Details, colors, angle, macro = quite stunning.</td>', 'Details, colors, angle, macro = quite stunning.', '2004-10-03 20:38:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(939130, 107096, 12962, '<td valign="top">Disturbing.</td>', 'Disturbing.', '2004-10-03 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(939131, 106529, 12962, '<td valign="top">Ten.</td>', 'Ten.', '2004-10-03 20:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(939132, 107937, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Arresting.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Arresting.', '2004-10-03 20:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(939135, 107574, 12962, '<td valign="top">Ten.</td>', 'Ten.', '2004-10-03 20:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(939137, 108027, 12962, '<td valign="top">Ten.</td>', 'Ten.', '2004-10-03 20:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(939141, 107747, 12962, '<td valign="top">My hometown!  Beautiful day, perfect time of the day for a photograph like this.  The lights of the streets and the car lights on the streets certainly weave a complex web.  The result is stunning.  There''s a halo around the Sears Tower that you could probably tone down.  Hope this wins  (see archiral''s winning photo and also my winning photo from the same location!).</td>', 'My hometown!  Beautiful day, perfect time of the day for a photograph like this.  The lights of the streets and the car lights on the streets certainly weave a complex web.  The result is stunning.  There''s a halo around the Sears Tower that you could probably tone down.  Hope this wins  (see archiral''s winning photo and also my winning photo from the same location!).', '2004-10-03 20:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(939154, 108103, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great image. Love the composition and timing + the chosen shutter speed. Would have looked evem better without that bit at bottom right. Well done.</td>', 'Great image. Love the composition and timing + the chosen shutter speed. Would have looked evem better without that bit at bottom right. Well done.', '2004-10-03 20:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(939157, 107574, 21714, '<td valign="top">Love this image. Beautifully photographed and processed. Well done.</td>', 'Love this image. Beautifully photographed and processed. Well done.', '2004-10-03 21:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(939158, 107934, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition. I notice a fair amount of jpg artifacts happening in  the green areas</td>', 'Nice color and composition. I notice a fair amount of jpg artifacts happening in  the green areas', '2004-10-03 21:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(939159, 107893, 12160, '<td valign="top">Well composed image. Where ever I look the leading lines draw my eyes toward the big lights on the ceiling which is well-exposed. One of my top picks. 9</td>', 'Well composed image. Where ever I look the leading lines draw my eyes toward the big lights on the ceiling which is well-exposed. One of my top picks. 9', '2004-10-03 21:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(939161, 107950, 20662, '<td valign="top">Been there -- live with this! You have all my sympathy. Congratulation on capturing it so well, excellent lighting</td>', 'Been there -- live with this! You have all my sympathy. Congratulation on capturing it so well, excellent lighting', '2004-10-03 21:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(939164, 108100, 21714, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition and the elements in the image. Great find - well done.</td>', 'I really like this composition and the elements in the image. Great find - well done.', '2004-10-03 21:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(939165, 108087, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge. Good colors and lighting. Not really fond of the border. 8</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge. Good colors and lighting. Not really fond of the border. 8', '2004-10-03 21:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(939185, 107893, 21317, '<td valign="top">Awesome!, I love the composition, detail. 10</td>', 'Awesome!, I love the composition, detail. 10', '2004-10-03 21:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(939186, 107946, 6520, '<td valign="top">9</td>', '9', '2004-10-03 21:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(939193, 107965, 17837, '<td valign="top">This title is way too long... not effecting the vote. Just wanted to voice an opinion on it.</td>', 'This title is way too long... not effecting the vote. Just wanted to voice an opinion on it.', '2004-10-03 21:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
