(939570, 107747, 2333, '<td valign="top">Hot damn! first blue ribbon! <br/> <br/>@flip89: I was aware of the other two shots, and hopefully I achieved my goal of an original take on this subject. I was in downtown Chicago all of week before last, and so my subject pretty much had to come from there.<br/>Thanks to all the voters who saw what I saw in this shot.</td>', 'Hot damn! first blue ribbon!  @flip89: I was aware of the other two shots, and hopefully I achieved my goal of an original take on this subject. I was in downtown Chicago all of week before last, and so my subject pretty much had to come from there.Thanks to all the voters who saw what I saw in this shot.', '2004-10-04 01:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
