(939635, 107893, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey Bob; you got this yellow without my help. Since I had already seen your spectacular image, I assumed this was somebody else''s and I did not see how anyone could have improved it. I like earlier better. So, I left you in my placeholder of 5 and that is where you stayed.<br/> <br/>I did not know it was you so I am guilty and sorry for overlooking it.<br/> <br/>So, as you win this yellow, my hat goes off to you and very smart to have entered this shot. Do not hate me for my oversight.</td>', 'Hey Bob; you got this yellow without my help. Since I had already seen your spectacular image, I assumed this was somebody else''s and I did not see how anyone could have improved it. I like earlier better. So, I left you in my placeholder of 5 and that is where you stayed. I did not know it was you so I am guilty and sorry for overlooking it. So, as you win this yellow, my hat goes off to you and very smart to have entered this shot. Do not hate me for my oversight.', '2004-10-04 01:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(939652, 108069, 19936, '<td valign="top">Robbed!  This shot should have done better.  At least IMHO.</td>', 'Robbed!  This shot should have done better.  At least IMHO.', '2004-10-04 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(939674, 106529, 22734, '<td valign="top">Jason: you are a wonder. I do not know why so many members refuse to extend the courtesy of the doubt when they fail to understand something because it is above their experience.<br/> <br/>Anyhow congrats on your 4th placing. I am sure you suffered at the start before validation. Since I am a victum of this I can clearly sympathize with you.<br/> <br/>Have no fear..top four shows that the image overcame the skeptics with their 1,2,3,4,5. <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work and my kudos for your creativity on this iamge. It rocks.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Jason: you are a wonder. I do not know why so many members refuse to extend the courtesy of the doubt when they fail to understand something because it is above their experience. Anyhow congrats on your 4th placing. I am sure you suffered at the start before validation. Since I am a victum of this I can clearly sympathize with you. Have no fear..top four shows that the image overcame the skeptics with their 1,2,3,4,5.  Keep up the good work and my kudos for your creativity on this iamge. It rocks. ', '2004-10-04 01:41:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(939680, 108101, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 5th placing. I can not believe the quality of great shots in this challenge. Yours is great because of that pastel shade that is so easy on the eyes. Very good effort.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 5th placing. I can not believe the quality of great shots in this challenge. Yours is great because of that pastel shade that is so easy on the eyes. Very good effort.', '2004-10-04 01:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(939685, 107973, 17304, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...the lighting and depth of field really sucks one into the picture. I think this one is going on the itinerary for next summer! Thanks for sharing this with us.</td>', 'Beautiful...the lighting and depth of field really sucks one into the picture. I think this one is going on the itinerary for next summer! Thanks for sharing this with us.', '2004-10-04 01:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(939691, 107747, 17304, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!! Amazing night scene.</td>', 'Congratulations!! Amazing night scene.', '2004-10-04 01:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(939699, 106825, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nico: Congratulations on your 6th placing. What is this...you are new here and all i see is Nico everywhere. I am so happy for you and keep it up...you have a lot of creativity and you are able to change styles.<br/> <br/>I love members like you because you help the accomplished to realize that competition is well and alive and they better look.<br/> <br/>Your entry is captivating and what I call a mind teaser because one has to do a double take. Any picture that makes the looker do a double...means you have created something above average. Go and beat this image.</td>', 'Nico: Congratulations on your 6th placing. What is this...you are new here and all i see is Nico everywhere. I am so happy for you and keep it up...you have a lot of creativity and you are able to change styles. I love members like you because you help the accomplished to realize that competition is well and alive and they better look. Your entry is captivating and what I call a mind teaser because one has to do a double take. Any picture that makes the looker do a double...means you have created something above average. Go and beat this image.', '2004-10-04 01:49:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(939724, 107607, 22734, '<td valign="top">hey Ann: Congratulations on your 7th placing. This is virtually unreal because it is virtually clear edge to edge. The water droplets, beads so tiny, yet with their own weight is unable to destroy the web, yes it may loose a contact here and there, but look at it. This stands out as one of your most interesting shots because your image draws an intricate pattern which pleases the eyes over and over. Your port is very nice and this addition enhances it more.</td>', 'hey Ann: Congratulations on your 7th placing. This is virtually unreal because it is virtually clear edge to edge. The water droplets, beads so tiny, yet with their own weight is unable to destroy the web, yes it may loose a contact here and there, but look at it. This stands out as one of your most interesting shots because your image draws an intricate pattern which pleases the eyes over and over. Your port is very nice and this addition enhances it more.', '2004-10-04 01:57:11.000000', NULL, 0),
