(940041, 107893, 8522, '<td valign="top">Graphicfunk, don''t worry about it!<br/>Thanks everyone, it''s been interesting to revisit an earlier shot and see if I could improve on it. I was never that convinced by the centered composition of the last one, but it seems that people prefer it that way. I''ve also learnt to keep to ISO50 wherever possible. You can''t see noise here because I NeatImaged it out, but it certainly doesn''t have the detail of the previous shot.</td>', 'Graphicfunk, don''t worry about it!Thanks everyone, it''s been interesting to revisit an earlier shot and see if I could improve on it. I was never that convinced by the centered composition of the last one, but it seems that people prefer it that way. I''ve also learnt to keep to ISO50 wherever possible. You can''t see noise here because I NeatImaged it out, but it certainly doesn''t have the detail of the previous shot.', '2004-10-04 06:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
