(942510, 107893, 27318, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition.  I find myself turning my head<br/>back and forth to see it at different angles.  The lighting is<br/>great!  I''m new to this forum so I haven''t seen your other picture,<br/>do you still have it available online?  I''m sorry I came in too<br/>late to vote, I liked your''s the best.<br/> <br/>  -Nick-<br/></td>', 'I really like the composition.  I find myself turning my headback and forth to see it at different angles.  The lighting isgreat!  I''m new to this forum so I haven''t seen your other picture,do you still have it available online?  I''m sorry I came in toolate to vote, I liked your''s the best.   -Nick-', '2004-10-05 06:46:55.000000', NULL, 0),
