(942513, 108066, 19831, '<td valign="top">Dude! <br/>I think you executed this very well. I think that the surfaces of the objects could really glare and reflect and stuff. Excellant lighting IMO. I''ve seen many "chess" shots, I like your choice of composition, the tight shot not showing the whole board, etc. Kewl pic!</td>', 'Dude! I think you executed this very well. I think that the surfaces of the objects could really glare and reflect and stuff. Excellant lighting IMO. I''ve seen many "chess" shots, I like your choice of composition, the tight shot not showing the whole board, etc. Kewl pic!', '2004-10-05 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
