(942670, 107893, 8522, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nickinpdx:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like the composition.  I find myself turning my head<br/>back and forth to see it at different angles.  The lighting is<br/>great!  I''m new to this forum so I haven''t seen your other picture,<br/>do you still have it available online?  I''m sorry I came in too<br/>late to vote, I liked your''s the best.<br/> <br/>  -Nick- </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just look at my profile... at this point in time, it''s my highest scoring shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by nickinpdx: I really like the composition.  I find myself turning my headback and forth to see it at different angles.  The lighting isgreat!  I''m new to this forum so I haven''t seen your other picture,do you still have it available online?  I''m sorry I came in toolate to vote, I liked your''s the best.   -Nick-   Just look at my profile... at this point in time, it''s my highest scoring shot.', '2004-10-05 10:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(942677, 107607, 25616, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the bunch...so much detail!!<br/>Well done!<br/></td>', 'My favorite of the bunch...so much detail!!Well done!', '2004-10-05 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(942703, 107338, 3724, '<td valign="top">Provocative image in that it forces exploration. Well made.  A ghosted interior reflection layered on glass over the twilight lit view - a simple idea - contempletive - beautiful, thoughtful snap from your commuter routine, my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Provocative image in that it forces exploration. Well made.  A ghosted interior reflection layered on glass over the twilight lit view - a simple idea - contempletive - beautiful, thoughtful snap from your commuter routine, my favorite of the challenge.', '2004-10-05 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(942730, 107973, 2798, '<td valign="top">Amazing place captured VERY well indeed. Makes me want to visit myself.</td>', 'Amazing place captured VERY well indeed. Makes me want to visit myself.', '2004-10-05 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(942740, 107747, 26520, '<td valign="top">awesome shot!</td>', 'awesome shot!', '2004-10-05 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(942970, 108069, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image obviously did not convey the sense of complexity to most voters and that was why it was voted so undeservingly low... as was true of most images submitted of people in this particular challenge.<br/> <br/>I liked the way you composed the picture and it has decent quality so I scored it a 6. Overall, it is a good picture.<br/> <br/>I made no comment on it during the challenge but if I had I would have made two suggestions for improvement...<br/> <br/>One, shoot at a higher aperture for greater DOF. That way all the hair on your daughter''s head would be in sharp focus. I don''t think going the other way around with the shallowest DOF possible focused off the eye would have worked as well, but that would be worth a try too.<br/> <br/>Two, either shoot her further from the wall or use your photoediting tool to make a smooth white background. The mottling in the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'This image obviously did not convey the sense of complexity to most voters and that was why it was voted so undeservingly low... as was true of most images submitted of people in this particular challenge. I liked the way you composed the picture and it has decent quality so I scored it a 6. Overall, it is a good picture. I made no comment on it during the challenge but if I had I would have made two suggestions for improvement... One, shoot at a higher aperture for greater DOF. That way all the hair on your daughter''s head would be in sharp focus. I don''t think going the other way around with the shallowest DOF possible focused off the eye would have worked as well, but that would be worth a try too. Two, either shoot her further from the wall or use your photoediting tool to make a smooth white background. The mottling in the background is a little distracting.', '2004-10-05 13:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(943397, 106529, 26153, '<td valign="top">Its great..</td>', 'Its great..', '2004-10-05 18:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
