(945120, 107483, 24925, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by luv2photo:</b></div><hr/><i> I am surprised this did not do better.  It truly communicated to me the complexity of electricity. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>True, but there are much better ways that I could have photographed this area...it was a rushed shoot and I wasn''t into it, otherwise I would have gone back at a better time (not 3 pm) and tried some different shots. I predicted about a 4.8 on this photo, so I can''t complain.<br/> <br/>Edit:  Thank you for the compliment.  :)<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-06 13:05:33.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by luv2photo: I am surprised this did not do better.  It truly communicated to me the complexity of electricity.   True, but there are much better ways that I could have photographed this area...it was a rushed shoot and I wasn''t into it, otherwise I would have gone back at a better time (not 3 pm) and tried some different shots. I predicted about a 4.8 on this photo, so I can''t complain. Edit:  Thank you for the compliment.  :)', '2004-10-06 09:29:19.000000', '2004-10-06 14:05:33.000000', 0),
