(953544, 107998, 24896, '<td valign="top">Hi arngrimur,<br/> <br/>Scott here from the Critique Club.<br/>I found this photo very pleasing to look at during voting for the challenge. A nice contrast between the varying reds and the blue sky. The only thing I think that may need some improvement on is the crop. It seems just a little too tight. But composition is still one of my weaker concepts. From looking at you profile I see you have a great eye. Your work is very creative and colourful. Kopavogur Church, The Door, The Viking Ship at Night, and Yellow are my favorites from you profile. Your work in general is very good and was a pleasure to look through. If you have any questions or comments please feel free to PM me.<br/> <br/>Scott.<br/></td>', 'Hi arngrimur, Scott here from the Critique Club.I found this photo very pleasing to look at during voting for the challenge. A nice contrast between the varying reds and the blue sky. The only thing I think that may need some improvement on is the crop. It seems just a little too tight. But composition is still one of my weaker concepts. From looking at you profile I see you have a great eye. Your work is very creative and colourful. Kopavogur Church, The Door, The Viking Ship at Night, and Yellow are my favorites from you profile. Your work in general is very good and was a pleasure to look through. If you have any questions or comments please feel free to PM me. Scott.', '2004-10-11 00:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
